https://freefilmfestivals.org/2026/04/26/short-film-open-call-peckham-nunhead-2026/\">Short Film Open Call Peckham &amp; Nunhead Festival 2026</a></h3>\n            <strong>26th April 2026</strong> - <p>Short Film Open Call Peckham &amp; Nunhead Festival 2026 is now live. The Peckham &amp; Nunhead Free Film Festival (PNFFF) 2026 is excited to announce&#8230;</p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"news_story\">\n\t\t\t<h5><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/2026/03/31/new-cross-deptford-free-film-festival-programme-is-live/\">New Cross &amp; Deptford Free Film Festival programme is live!</a></h3>\n            <strong>31st March 2026</strong> - <p>The New Cross &amp; Deptford Free Film Festival is proud to announce TEN days of free films, at EIGHTEEN venues around SE8 and SE14 &#8211;&#8230;</p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t    <strong><div class=\"readall\"><a href=\"/category/blog\">READ ALL</a></div></strong>\n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-twitter sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4> <span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span>Latest Tweets</h4>\n    <a height=\"250\" data-screen-name=\"freefilmfests\" class=\"twitter-timeline\" data-theme=\"light\" data-chrome=\"transparent nofooter noheader noborders\"  href=\"https://twitter.com/freefilmfests\" data-widget-id=\"696411500521660416\">Tweets by @freefilmfest</a>\n    <script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+\"://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js\";fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\"script\",\"twitter-wjs\");</script>          \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-newsletter sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Next Event</h4>\t\n                        \n    \t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"highlight\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/mamma-mia-0-poster_1-scaled.jpg); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/mamma-mia/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mini-film-date\">21st August 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">Mamma Mia!</h3>            \n\t\t\t<div class=\"mini-film-venue\">St George&#8217;s Garrison Church, Woolwich | 8:00PM</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t \n       \n</div> \n\n<div class=\"sidebar-newsletter sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Get Involved</h4>\t\n                        \n        <p>Free Film Festivals are completely run by volunteers. Each festival is always looking for more volunteers, so drop them a message through the Contact Us page if you’d like to get involved, and they’ll get back to you soon.</p>\n    <div class=\"readmore\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/get-involved/\">Read More</a></div>\n       \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-newsletter sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Newsletter</h4>\t\n                        \n    <p>Keep up to date with all of our latest news, offers and events</p>\n    \n    <div class=\"footer-contact\">                \n        \n<div class=\"wpcf7 no-js\" id=\"wpcf7-f39-o1\" lang=\"en-US\" dir=\"ltr\" data-wpcf7-id=\"39\">\n<div class=\"screen-reader-response\"><p role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></p> <ul></ul></div>\n<form action=\"/explore-our-festivals/#wpcf7-f39-o1\" method=\"post\" class=\"wpcf7-form init\" aria-label=\"Contact form\" novalidate=\"novalidate\" data-status=\"init\">\n<fieldset class=\"hidden-fields-container\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7\" value=\"39\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_version\" value=\"6.1.6\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_locale\" value=\"en_US\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_unit_tag\" value=\"wpcf7-