m-object-page menu-item-680\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/start-a-festival/\">Start A Festival</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-31\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-31\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/get-involved/\">Get Involved</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-30\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-30\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/contact-us/\">Contact</a></li>\n</ul></div>                        </div>                                            \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"header-banner-logo\">\n            \t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\" rel=\"home\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/round-logo.png\" alt=\"Free Film Festivals Logo\"/></a>\n            </div>\n        \t\n            \n            \n        </div>\t            \n\n<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\" style=\"position:relative;\">\n \n\t<div class=\"content-topper\">\n    \t&nbsp;\n    </div>\n    \n \t<div class=\"site-content-inner\">   \n \n \t\t\n        <div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area\">\n            <main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\" role=\"main\">\n            \n            \t<div class=\"left-panel-main col-3\" style=\"padding-top:0px;\">\n                \t<div class=\"left-panel-main-inner\" style=\"padding-top:25px;\">\n                    \n                                            <div class=\"devshare\">\n                        Share\n                        <div class=\"dev-share-buttons\" data-share-title=\"Mamma Mia!\" data-share-text=\"\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Fmamma-mia%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--facebook\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Fmamma-mia%2F&text=Mamma%20Mia%21\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--twitter\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://plus.google.com/share?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Fmamma-mia%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--google\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-google\"></span></a> </div> \n                        </div>\n                                        \n                    <div id=\"tribe-events\" class=\"tribe-no-js\" data-live_ajax=\"1\" data-datepicker_format=\"0\" data-category=\"\" data-featured=\"\"><div class=\"tribe-events-before-html\"></div><span class=\"tribe-events-ajax-loading\"><img class=\"tribe-events-spinner-medium\" src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/plugins/the-events-calendar/src/resources/images/tribe-loading.gif\" alt=\"Loading Events\" /></span>\t\t\t\t\t\n<div id=\"tribe-events-content\" class=\"tribe-events-single\">\n\n\t<!-- Notices -->\n\t\n\t<h2 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-date\">Friday 21st August 2026</h2>\n    \n\t<h1 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-title\">Mamma Mia!</h1>\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-schedule tribe-clearfix\">\t\n    \n    \t    \t\t            \t<span class=\"tribe-events-cost\">Free</span>\n\t            <span class=\"free\">(No ticket required - First come first served)</span>            \n\t\t\t\t</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tribe-time-header tribe-clearfix\">\t\t\n\t\t8:00PM        \t\t\t(Doors open 7pm)\n\t\t\t</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tribe-venue-header tribe-clearfix\">\t\t\n    \t\t\t\t<span>OUTDOOR:</span> St George&#8217;s Garrison Church, Woolwich<br />\n            Bring something to sit on and whatever you need to stay warm and dry\n        \t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-99701\" class=\"post-99701 tribe_events type-tribe_events status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry tag-outdoor tribe_events_cat-other-free-film-festival-screenings filmfestival-other cat_other-free-film-festival-screenings\">\n\t\t\t\n            <!-- Event content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/mamma-mia-0-poster_1-691x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Poster for the film Mamma Mia! showing Amanda Seyfried in a white dress holding a floral bouquet against a glittering blue sea backdrop\" width=\"691\" height=\"1024\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-9763\" srcset=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/mamma-mia-0-poster_1-691x1024.jpg 691w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/mamma-mia-0-poster_1-202x300.jpg 202w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/mamma-mia-0-poster_1-768x1138.jpg 768w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/mamma-mia-0-poster_1-1037x1536.jpg 1037w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/mamma-mia-0-poster_1-1382x2048.jpg 1382w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/mamma-mia-0-poster_1-57x85.jpg 57w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/mamma-mia-0-poster_1-115x170.jpg 115w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/mamma-mia-0-poster_1-1200x1778.jpg 1200w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/mamma-mia-0-poster_1-scaled.jpg 1728w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 709px) 85vw, (max-width: 909px) 67vw, (max-width: 984px) 61vw, (max-width: 1362px) 45vw, 600px\" /></p>\n<p>Set on an idyllic Greek island, the plot serves as a background for a wealth of ABBA hit songs. Donna, an independent, single mother who owns a small hotel on the island is about to let go of Sophie, the spirited young daughter she’s raised alone. But Sophie has secretly invited three of her mother’s ex-lovers in the hopes of finding her father.</p>\n<p>This is a special screening on behalf of Charlton &#038; Woolwich Free Film Festival in conjunction with St George&#8217;s Garrison Church Woolwich.</p>\n<p>We hope you can join us for this classic flim!</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n            \n            <!-- .tribe-events-single-event-description -->\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<!-- Event meta -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-section tribe-events-event-meta primary tribe-clearfix\">\n\n\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-other\">\n\t<h3 class=\"tribe-events-single-section-title\"> Other </h3>\n\t<dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Director </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tPhyllida Lloyd\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Certificate </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tPG\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Running Time </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t1hr 49mins\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Year </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t2008\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Country </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tUSA\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t</dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-venue\">\n\t<dl>\n\t\t\n\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue\">St George&#8217;s Garrison Church, Woolwich </dd>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue-location\">\n\t\t\t\t<address class=\"tribe-events-address\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-address\">\n\n<span class=\"tribe-street-address\">A205 South Circular - Grand Depot Road</span>\n\t\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-delimiter\">,</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-locality\">London</span><span class=\"tribe-delimiter\">,</span>\n\n\n\t<span class=\"tribe-postal-code\">SE18 6BW</span>\n\n\t<span class=\"tribe-country-name\">United Kingdom</span>\n\n</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</address>\n\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Phone: </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue-tel\"> 07544 056917 </dd>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Website: </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"url\"> <a href=\"https://www.stgeorgeswoolwich.org\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.stgeorgeswoolwich.org</a> </dd>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</dl>\n</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\n                        \t\t\n            \n\t\t</div> <!-- #post-x -->\n\t\t\t\t\n\n</div><!-- #tribe-events-content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-after-html\"></div></div><!-- #tribe-events -->\n<!--\nThis calendar is powered by The Events Calendar.\nhttp://evnt.is/18wn\n-->\n                \t\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div id=\"sidepanel-right\" class=\"right-panel-main col-1\">\n                \t<div class=\"right-panel-main-inner\">\n                \t<div class=\"sidebar-contact sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Contact</h4>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-social\">\n    \t                        \n\t\t\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-top:30px;\">        \n\t        </div>    \n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-search sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Search</h4>\n    <div class=\"searchpanel\">\n\t\t\n<form role=\"search\" method=\"get\" class=\"search-form\" action=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\">\n\t<label>\n\t\t<span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Search for:</span>\n\t\t<input type=\"search\" class=\"search-field\" placeholder=\"Search &hellip;\" value=\"\" name=\"s\" title=\"Search for:\" />\n\t</label>\t\n</form>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-news sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Latest News</h4>\n    \n    \t\t<div class=\"news_story\">\n\t\t\t<h5><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/2023/10/14/5-harry-potter-%f0%9f%8e%83-halloween-screening-woolwich-home-movie-day-and-save-the-white-swan/\">CANCELLED: £5 Harry Potter &#8211; 🎃 Hallowe&#8217;en screening, Woolwich + Home Movie Day and Save The White Swan</a></h5>\n            <strong>14th October 2023</strong> - <p>Note that the Harry Potter event has been cancelled. If you&#8217;re subscribed to the Charlton and Woolwich Free Film Festival&#8217;s mailing list you&#8217;ll have received&#8230;</p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t    <div class=\"readall\"><a href=\"/category/blog\"><strong>READ ALL</strong></a></div>\n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-twitter sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4> <span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span>Latest Tweets</h4>\n        \t<a height=\"200\" data-screen-name=\"freefilmfests\" class=\"twitter-timeline\" data-theme=\"light\" data-chrome=\"transparent nofooter noheader noborders\"  href=\"https://twitter.com/freefilmfests\" data-widget-id=\"696411500521660416\">Tweets by @freefilmfests</a>\n    \t<script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+\"://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js\";fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\"script\",\"twitter-wjs\");</script>              \n    </div>                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"divide\"></div>\n                \n                                \n                <div class=\"fff-calendar-container\" style=\"padding-left:0; margin-top:20px;\">\n                \n                \t<div class=\"calendar-heading\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a name=\"cal\"></a>\n                        \n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>All Events</h2>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"cal-menu\">                    \t\n                            <span class=\"icon-cal\">Calendar</span>\n                            <span class=\"icon-list\">List</span>\n                            <span class=\"icon-images icon-cal-selected\">Images</span>                        \n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n                                        \t\n                    </div>\n                \t\n                    <div class=\"films\">\n                    \t<div class=\"filmimages\" style=\"display:block\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"film-image-list col-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/mamma-mia-0-poster_1-scaled.jpg); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/mamma-mia/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mini-film-date\">21st August 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">Mamma Mia!</h3>            \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mini-film-venue\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/venue/st-georges-garrison-church-woolwich/\">St George&#8217;s Garrison Church, Woolwich</a><br />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t8:00PM</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"film-image-list col-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/PADDINGTON-IN-PERU-1-1-scaled.jpg); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/paddington-in-peru-2/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mini-film-date\">22nd August 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">Paddington in Peru</h3>            \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mini-film-venue\">Fortune Green<br />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t8:00PM</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"filmlist\">    \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/mamma-mia-0-poster_1-scaled.jpg); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/mamma-mia/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">21st August 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">Mamma Mia!</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        August 21 @ 8:00 pm<br />\n                                        St George&#8217;s Garrison Church, Woolwich\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>Set on an idyllic Greek island, the plot serves as a background for a wealth of ABBA hit songs. Donna, an independent, single mother who&#8230;</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/mamma-mia/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\n                            </div>\n                                \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/PADDINGTON-IN-PERU-1-1-scaled.jpg); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/paddington-in-peru-2/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">22nd August 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">Paddington in Peru</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        August 22 @ 8:00 pm<br />\n                                        Fortune Green\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>When Paddington discovers his Aunt Lucy is missing he and the Brown family head to Peru to find her. Join us at Fortune Green for&#8230;</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                    