"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--facebook\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fpeckham-nunhead%2F&text=Film%20Festivals%3A%20%3Cspan%3EPeckham%20%26amp%3B%20Nunhead%3C%2Fspan%3E\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--twitter\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://plus.google.com/share?url=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fpeckham-nunhead%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--google\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-google\"></span></a> </div> \n                    </div>\n                    \n                                                                            \t<h2 style=\"margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">Next Event</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                            \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-frame\" style=\"background-image:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/film-quiz.jpeg); background-size:cover; background-repeat:no-repeat;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/picture-frame.png\" alt=\"picture frame\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-title-stuff\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/pre-festival-film-pub-quiz-2/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/picture-frame-details.png\" alt=\"picture frame details\" /></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-title-stuff-copy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/pre-festival-film-pub-quiz-2/\">Pre-Festival Film Pub Quiz</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"film-date\">September 2 @ 8:00 pm</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"film-venue\">The Ivy House</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n                                \n                                <div class=\"next-festival-copy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>It’s here! We’ve now launched the full line-up for this year’s festival, block out the time in your diary/phone as you won’t want to miss the goodies we have in store for you.</p>\n<p>Look out for posters and programme flyers throughout the local area and you can also <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2026-program-WEB.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">download the full programme here</a>. Make sure you follow us on our socials (details below) for all the latest news and updates.</p>\n<p>We can’t wait to bring you these exciting screening events and workshops. Join us for a pre-festival movie quiz on Wednesday 2 September before the festival officially kicks off on Friday 4 September.</p>\n<p>You can see there really is something for everyone, whatever your age or taste in movies. Browse through the rest of our website for full details about each individual event. This is your chance to discover something new, or rediscover something from your past.  All experienced in unique Peckham and Nunhead venues alongside your friends and neighbours. </p>\n<p><strong>Peckham &#038; Nunhead Free Film Festival (PNFFF) is now in its 17th year of bringing completely free movie entertainment to communities across SE15</strong>. All thanks to the volunteers who organise and run it.</p>\n<p><strong>Interested in getting involved? We’d love to hear from you</strong>. You can pick up new skills, build links in your local community and throw your own experience and film passions into the mix. Email <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#cebea0a8a8a88ea8bcababa8a7a2a3a8abbdbaa7b8afa2bde0a1bca9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"86f6e8e0e0e0c6e0f4e3e3e0efeaebe0e3f5f2eff0e7eaf5a8e9f4e1\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> to find out more. </p>\n<p>If you&#8217;re able, we’d really appreciate a donation to help make the festival happen. Please use the QR code below or <a href=\"https://pay.sumup.com/b2c/QDU3LSCE\">click here</a></p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-66845\" src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/qrcode.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" /></p>\n<p>f: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/peckhamfreefilmfestival\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> peckhamfreefilmfestival</a><br />\nx: <a href=\"https://twitter.com/freefilmfest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> freefilmfest</a><br />\ni: <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/_pnfff/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> _pnfff</a><br />\ny: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/FreeFilmFestivals/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> YouTube</a><br />\nl: <a href=\"https://letterboxd.com/pnfff/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Letterboxd</a><br />\nb: <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/pnfff.bsky.social/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> BlueSky</a><br />\ne: <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#6a1a040c0c0c2a0c180f0f0c0306070c0f191e031c0b06194405180d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"9cecf2fafafadcfaeef9f9faf5f0f1faf9efe8f5eafdf0efb2f3eefb\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p>\n<p>We are part of Free Film Festivals, a network of volunteer-powered neighbourhood free film festivals.</p>\n<p>Click on the ‘Festival archive’ link below for details of previous events.</p>\n                                </div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                    \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div id=\"sidepanel-right\" class=\"right-panel-main col-1\">\n                \t<div class=\"right-panel-main-inner\">\n                \t<div class=\"sidebar-contact sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Contact</h4>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-social\">\n    \t        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/peckhamfreefilmfestival\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook-alt\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.twitter.com/freefilmfest\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#d0a0beb6b6b690b6a2b5b5b6b9bcbdb6b5a3a4b9a6b1bca3febfa2b7\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-mail\"></span></a>\n\t\t\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-top:30px;\">        \n\t    <div><a href=\"https://twitter.com/https://www.twitter.com/freefilmfest\" class=\"twitter-follow-button\" data-show-count=\"false\" data-size=\"large\">Follow @https://www.twitter.com/freefilmfest</a>\n    <script data-cfasync=\"false\" src=\"/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js\"></script><script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+'://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document, 'script', 'twitter-wjs');</script></div>\n            <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/peckhamfreefilmfestival\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-action=\"like\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-share=\"false\"></div>\n        </div>    \n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-search sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Search</h4>\n    <div class=\"searchpanel\">\n\t\t\n<form role=\"search\" method=\"get\" class=\"search-form\" action=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\">\n\t<label>\n\t\t<span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Search for:</span>\n\t\t<input type=\"search\" class=\"search-field\" placeholder=\"Search &hellip;\" value=\"\" name=\"s\" title=\"Search for:\" />\n\t</label>\t\n</form>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-news sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Latest News</h4>\n    \n    \t\t<div class=\"news_story\">\n\t\t\t<h5><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/2026/04/26/short-film-open-call-peckham-nunhead-2026/\">Short Film Open Call Peckham &amp; Nunhead Festival 2026</a></h5>\n            <strong>26th April 2026</strong> - <p>Short Film Open Call Peckham &amp; Nunhead Festival 2026 is now live. The Peckham &amp; Nunhead Free Film Festival (PNFFF) 2026 is excited to announce&#8230;</p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t    <div class=\"readall\"><a href=\"/category/blog\"><strong>READ ALL</strong></a></div>\n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-twitter sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4> <span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span>Latest Tweets</h4>\n        \t<a height=\"200\" data-screen-name=\"FreeFilmFest\" class=\"twitter-timeline\" data-theme=\"light\" data-chrome=\"transparent nofooter noheader noborders\"  href=\"https://www.twitter.com/freefilmfest\" data-widget-id=\"696411500521660416\">Tweets by @@FreeFilmFest</a>\n    \t<script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+\"://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js\";fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\"script\",\"twitter-wjs\");</script>          \n    </div>                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"divide\"></div>\n    \n   \t\t\t\n   \t\t\t\n   \t\t\t\n   \t\t\t\n   \t\t\t\n    \t\t\t<div class=\"fff-calendar-container\" style=\"padding-left:0;\">\n                \n                \t<div class=\"calendar-heading\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a name=\"cal\"></a>\n                        \n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>All Events</h2>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"cal-menu\"> \n                            <span class=\"icon-cal\n                                                        \">Calendar</span>\n                            <span class=\"icon-list\">List</span>\n                            <span class=\"icon-images\n                                                        \">Images</span>                                                    \n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n                                        \t\n                    </div>\n                \t\n                    <div class=\"films\">\n                    \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"filmimages\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"film-image-list col-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/film-quiz.jpeg); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/pre-festival-film-pub-quiz-2/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mini-film-date\">02nd September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">Pre-Festival Film Pub Quiz</h3>            \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mini-film-venue\">The Ivy House<br />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t8:00PM</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"film-image-list col-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Blue-Velvet.jpg); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/blue-velvet/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\