aynes Park</a></li>\n\t<li id=\"menu-item-9572\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-taxonomy menu-item-object-filmfestival menu-item-9572\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/south-social/\">South Social</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-2570\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-2570\"><a href=\"/whats-on/?view=cal\">What&#8217;s On</a></li>\n</ul></div>                                </nav><!-- .main-navigation -->\n                                                        \n                        </div><!-- .site-header-menu -->\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    <div class=\"col-2\">        \n                        <div class=\"top-navigation menualignright\" aria-label=\"Top Right Menu\">\n                            <div class=\"menu-top-right-container\"><ul id=\"menu-top-right\" class=\"top-menu\"><li id=\"menu-item-680\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-680\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/start-a-festival/\">Start A Festival</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-31\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-31\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/get-involved/\">Get Involved</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-30\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-30\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/contact-us/\">Contact</a></li>\n</ul></div>                        </div>                                            \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"header-banner-logo\">\n            \t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\" rel=\"home\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/round-logo.png\" alt=\"Free Film Festivals Logo\"/></a>\n            </div>\n        \t\n            \n            \n        </div>\t            \n\n<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\" style=\"position:relative;\">\n \n\t<div class=\"content-topper\">\n    \t&nbsp;\n    </div>\n    \n \t<div class=\"site-content-inner\">   \n \n \t\t\n        <div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area\">\n            <main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\" role=\"main\">\n            \n            \t<div class=\"left-panel-main col-3\" style=\"padding-top:0px;\">\n                \t<div class=\"left-panel-main-inner\" style=\"padding-top:25px;\">\n                    \n                                            <div class=\"devshare\">\n                        Share\n                        <div class=\"dev-share-buttons\" data-share-title=\"rOUGH (aS oWT) cINEMA wORKSHOP: Hosted by Sean Grundy, writer/director of new Musical film tHE iNVISIBLES\" data-share-text=\"\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Frough-as-owt-cinema-workshop-hosted-by-sean-grundy-writer-director-of-new-musical-film-the-invisibles%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--facebook\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Frough-as-owt-cinema-workshop-hosted-by-sean-grundy-writer-director-of-new-musical-film-the-invisibles%2F&text=rOUGH%20%28aS%20oWT%29%20cINEMA%20wORKSHOP%3A%20Hosted%20by%20Sean%20Grundy%2C%20writer%2Fdirector%20of%20new%20Musical%20film%20tHE%20iNVISIBLES\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--twitter\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://plus.google.com/share?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Frough-as-owt-cinema-workshop-hosted-by-sean-grundy-writer-director-of-new-musical-film-the-invisibles%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--google\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-google\"></span></a> </div> \n                        </div>\n                                        \n                    <div id=\"tribe-events\" class=\"tribe-no-js\" data-live_ajax=\"1\" data-datepicker_format=\"0\" data-category=\"\" data-featured=\"\"><div class=\"tribe-events-before-html\"></div><span class=\"tribe-events-ajax-loading\"><img class=\"tribe-events-spinner-medium\" src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/plugins/the-events-calendar/src/resources/images/tribe-loading.gif\" alt=\"Loading Events\" /></span>\t\t\t\t\t\n<div id=\"tribe-events-content\" class=\"tribe-events-single\">\n\n\t<!-- Notices -->\n\t\n\t<h2 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-date\">Saturday 12th September 2026</h2>\n    \n\t<h1 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-title\">rOUGH (aS oWT) cINEMA wORKSHOP: Hosted by Sean Grundy, writer/director of new Musical film tHE iNVISIBLES</h1>\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-schedule tribe-clearfix\">\t\n    \n    \t    \t\t            \t<span class=\"tribe-events-cost\">Free</span>\n\t            <span class=\"free\">(No ticket required - First come first served)</span>            \n\t\t\t\t</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tribe-time-header tribe-clearfix\">\t\t\n\t\t2:00PM        \t</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tribe-venue-header tribe-clearfix\">\t\t\n    \t        \t<span>INDOOR:</span> Mountview Academy of Theatre Arts        \t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-99370\" class=\"post-99370 tribe_events type-tribe_events status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry tribe_events_cat-peckham-nunhead-free-film-festival filmfestival-peckham-nunhead cat_peckham-nunhead-free-film-festival\">\n\t\t\t\n            <!-- Event content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>A unique opportunity with award winning director <strong>SEAN GRUNDY</strong> at <strong>MOUNTVIEW</strong> <strong>drama school</strong>, <strong>120 PECKHAM HILL STREET SE15 5JT</strong>, <strong>Saturday 12 September</strong>,<strong> 2PM</strong>.</p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-99372\" src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/the-invisibles-300x160.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"160\" srcset=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/the-invisibles-300x160.jpg 300w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/the-invisibles-1024x545.jpg 1024w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/the-invisibles-768x409.jpg 768w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/the-invisibles-85x45.jpg 85w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/the-invisibles-170x91.jpg 170w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/the-invisibles.jpg 1097w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 85vw, 300px\" /></p>\n<p>How to make a feature film with zero budget. A live experiment using excerpts from the new musical feature film <em>tHE iNVISIBLES</em>.</p>\n<p>Participants can reverse-engineer scenes from the film using DIY, punk-like Dogma inspired <em>rOUGH (aS oWT) cINEMA</em> approaches. A hands on inclusive session to get your own filmmaking adventure started.</p>\n<p><em>Mountview is one of the Uk’s leading drama schools. Established at the state of the art Peckham campus in 2018, its alumni include Grace Hodgett Young, Louisa Harland and Eddie Marsan.</em></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n            \n            <!-- .tribe-events-single-event-description -->\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<!-- Event meta -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-section tribe-events-event-meta primary tribe-clearfix\">\n\n\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-other\">\n\t<h3 class=\"tribe-events-single-section-title\"> Other </h3>\n\t<dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Director </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tSean Grundy\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Certificate </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t18\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Running Time </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t85 mins\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Year </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t2026\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Country </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tUK\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t</dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-venue\">\n\t<dl>\n\t\t\n\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue\">Mountview Academy of Theatre Arts </dd>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue-location\">\n\t\t\t\t<address class=\"tribe-events-address\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-address\">\n\n<span class=\"tribe-street-address\">120 Peckham Hill Street</span>\n\t\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-delimiter\">,</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-locality\">London</span><span class=\"tribe-delimiter\">,</span>\n\n\n\t<span class=\"tribe-postal-code\">SE15 5JT</span>\n\n\t<span class=\"tribe-country-name\">United Kingdom</span>\n\n</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</address>\n\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</dl>\n</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\n                        \t\t\n            \n\t\t</div> <!-- #post-x -->\n\t\t\t\t\n\n</div><!-- #tribe-events-content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-after-html\"></div></div><!-- #tribe-events -->\n<!--\nThis calendar is powered by The Events Calendar.\nhttp://evnt.is/18wn\n-->\n                \t\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div id=\"sidepanel-right\" class=\"right-panel-main col-1\">\n                \t<div class=\"right-panel-main-inner\">\n                \t<div class=\"sidebar-contact sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Contact</h4>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-social\">\n    \t        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/peckhamfreefilmfestival\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook-alt\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.twitter.com/freefilmfest\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\