                                  \n                        </div><!-- .site-header-menu -->\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    <div class=\"col-2\">        \n                        <div class=\"top-navigation menualignright\" aria-label=\"Top Right Menu\">\n                            <div class=\"menu-top-right-container\"><ul id=\"menu-top-right\" class=\"top-menu\"><li id=\"menu-item-680\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-680\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/start-a-festival/\">Start A Festival</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-31\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-31\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/get-involved/\">Get Involved</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-30\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-30\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/contact-us/\">Contact</a></li>\n</ul></div>                        </div>                                            \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"header-banner-logo\">\n            \t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\" rel=\"home\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/round-logo.png\" alt=\"Free Film Festivals Logo\"/></a>\n            </div>\n        \t\n            \n            \n        </div>\t            \n\n<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\" style=\"position:relative;\">\n \n\t<div class=\"content-topper\">\n    \t&nbsp;\n    </div>\n    \n \t<div class=\"site-content-inner\">   \n \n        <div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area\">\n            <main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\" role=\"main\">\n    \t\n            \t<div class=\"left-panel-footer col-3\">\n                \t<div class=\"left-panel-main-inner\" style=\"padding-top:30px;\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"devshare\">\n                    Share\n                    <div class=\"dev-share-buttons\" data-share-title=\"Streatham\" data-share-text=\"Share\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fstreatham%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--facebook\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fstreatham%2F&text=Film%20Festivals%3A%20%3Cspan%3EStreatham%3C%2Fspan%3E\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--twitter\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://plus.google.com/share?url=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fstreatham%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--google\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-google\"></span></a> </div> \n                    </div>\n                    \n                                                                            \t<h2 style=\"margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">Next Event</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                            \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-frame\" style=\"background-image:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-03-at-11.03.27.png); background-size:cover; background-repeat:no-repeat;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/picture-frame.png\" alt=\"picture frame\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-title-stuff\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/jurassic-park-outdoors/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/picture-frame-details.png\" alt=\"picture frame details\" /></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-title-stuff-copy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/jurassic-park-outdoors/\">Jurassic Park (OUTDOORS)</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"film-date\">September 5 @ 7:15 pm</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"film-venue\">The Rookery</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n                                \n                                <div class=\"next-festival-copy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In 2026, Streatham Free Film Festival returns for its <strong>11th edition</strong>, bringing three weeks of free, volunteer-powered cinema to venues across Streatham from <strong>1–20 September</strong>.</p>\n<p>This year&#8217;s programme celebrates the creativity, diversity and community spirit that make Streatham such a special place. From beloved classics and inspiring documentaries to family favourites and cult gems, the festival once again transforms local spaces into unique pop-up cinemas, creating unforgettable shared experiences for audiences of all ages.<br />\nThe 2026 festival programme includes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Three outdoor cinema screenings</strong> in iconic local locations</li>\n<li><strong>Live music and film events</strong> celebrating the connection between sound and screen</li>\n<li><strong>A showcase of emerging talent</strong> at our London filmmakers&#8217; short film night</li>\n<li><strong>Special screenings</strong> in some of Streatham&#8217;s most distinctive community venues</li>\n<li><strong>Opportunities</strong> to discover new stories, meet neighbours and celebrate local culture</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re joining us under the stars, discovering a hidden cinematic gem, or enjoying live music before a screening, there&#8217;s something for everyone at this year&#8217;s festival.</p>\n<p>Come along and help us celebrate volunteer-powered cinema from Streatham Hill to Vale.</p>\n<p>If you’d like to <strong>get involved</strong> in helping at this year&#8217;s festival or future screenings, we&#8217;d love to hear from you. Streatham Free Film Festival is part of the Free Film Festivals network, a group of volunteer-run neighbourhood film festivals dedicated to bringing free cinema to local communities.</p>\n<p>Click on the <strong>‘Festival archive’</strong> link below to see what happened previously.</p>\n<p>Follow Us:<br />\n<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/streathamfilm?locale=en_GB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Facebook: @streathamfilm</a><br />\n<a href=\"https://x.com/streathamfilm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">X: @streathamfilm</a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/streathamfilm/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Instagram: @streathamfilm</a></p>\n                                </div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                    \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div id=\"sidepanel-right\" class=\"right-panel-main col-1\">\n                \t<div class=\"right-panel-main-inner\">\n                \t<div class=\"sidebar-contact sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Contact</h4>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-social\">\n    \t        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/streathamfreefilmfestival\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook-alt\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/streathamfilm\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#d5a6a1a7b0b4a1bdb4b895b3a7b0b0b3bcb9b8b3b0a6a1bca3b4b9a6fbbaa7b2\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-mail\"></span></a>\n\t\t\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-top:30px;\">        \n\t    <div><a href=\"https://twitter.com/https://twitter.com/streathamfilm\" class=\"twitter-follow-button\" data-show-count=\"false\" data-size=\"large\">Follow @https://twitter.com/streathamfilm</a>\n    <script data-cfasync=\"false\" src=\"/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js\"></script><script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+'://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document, 'script', 'twitter-wjs');</script></div>\n            <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"http://www.facebook.com/streathamfreefilmfestival\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-action=\"like\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-share=\"false\"></div>\n        </div>    \n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-search sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Search</h4>\n    <div class=\"searchpanel\">\n\t\t\n<form role=\"search\" method=\"get\" class=\"search-form\" action=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\">\n\t<label>\n\t\t<span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Search for:</span>\n\t\t<input type=\"search\" class=\"search-field\" placeholder=\"Search &hellip;\" value=\"\" name=\"s\" title=\"Search for:\" />\n\t</label>\t\n</form>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-news sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Latest News</h4>\n    \n    \t\t<div class=\"news_story\">\n\t\t\t<h5><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/2023/09/01/46-free-film-screenings-in-south-london-begin-today-with-free-film-festivals/\">46 free film screenings in South London begin today, with Free Film Festivals</a></h5>\n            <strong>1st September 2023</strong> - <p>The Free Film Festivals September season begins today! We have 46 film screenings taking place this month across Peckham and Nunhead, Streatham, New Cross &amp;&#8230;</p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t    <div class=\"readall\"><a href=\"/category/blog\"><strong>READ ALL</strong></a></div>\n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-twitter sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4> <span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span>Latest Tweets</h4>\n        \t<a height=\"200\" data-screen-name=\"StreathamFilm\" class=\"twitter-timeline\" data-theme=\"light\" data-chrome=\"transparent nofooter noheader noborders\"  href=\"