    <div class=\"header-banner-logo\">\n            \t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\" rel=\"home\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/round-logo.png\" alt=\"Free Film Festivals Logo\"/></a>\n            </div>\n        \t\n            \n            \n        </div>\t            \n\n<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\" style=\"position:relative;\">\n \n\t<div class=\"content-topper\">\n    \t&nbsp;\n    </div>\n    \n \t<div class=\"site-content-inner\">   \n \n \t\t\n        <div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area\">\n            <main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\" role=\"main\">\n            \n            \t<div class=\"left-panel-main col-3\" style=\"padding-top:0px;\">\n                \t<div class=\"left-panel-main-inner\" style=\"padding-top:25px;\">\n                    \n                                            <div class=\"devshare\">\n                        Share\n                        <div class=\"dev-share-buttons\" data-share-title=\"RESPECT\" data-share-text=\"\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Frespect-2%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--facebook\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Frespect-2%2F&text=RESPECT\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--twitter\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://plus.google.com/share?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Frespect-2%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--google\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-google\"></span></a> </div> \n                        </div>\n                                        \n                    <div id=\"tribe-events\" class=\"tribe-no-js\" data-live_ajax=\"1\" data-datepicker_format=\"0\" data-category=\"\" data-featured=\"\"><div class=\"tribe-events-before-html\"></div><span class=\"tribe-events-ajax-loading\"><img class=\"tribe-events-spinner-medium\" src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/plugins/the-events-calendar/src/resources/images/tribe-loading.gif\" alt=\"Loading Events\" /></span>\t\t\t\t\t\n<div id=\"tribe-events-content\" class=\"tribe-events-single\">\n\n\t<!-- Notices -->\n\t\n\t<h2 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-date\">Friday 11th September 2026</h2>\n    \n\t<h1 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-title\">RESPECT</h1>\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-schedule tribe-clearfix\">\t\n    \n    \t    \t\t            \t<span class=\"tribe-events-cost\">Free</span>\n\t            <span class=\"free\">(No ticket required - First come first served)</span>            \n\t\t\t\t</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tribe-time-header tribe-clearfix\">\t\t\n\t\t8:00PM        \t\t\t(Doors open 7pm)\n\t\t\t</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tribe-venue-header tribe-clearfix\">\t\t\n    \t        \t<span>INDOOR:</span> Ruach Church (Streatham Hill Theatre)        \t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-99642\" class=\"post-99642 tribe_events type-tribe_events status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry tag-streatham-free-film tribe_events_cat-streatham tribe_events_cat-streatham-free-film-festival filmfestival-streatham cat_streatham cat_streatham-free-film-festival\">\n\t\t\t\n            <!-- Event content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<blockquote><p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-99639\" src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/REspect-landscape-Poster-300x140.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"403\" height=\"188\" srcset=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/REspect-landscape-Poster-300x141.png 300w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/REspect-landscape-Poster-1024x477.png 1024w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/REspect-landscape-Poster-768x358.png 768w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/REspect-landscape-Poster-85x40.png 85w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/REspect-landscape-Poster-170x79.png 170w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/REspect-landscape-Poster.png 1034w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 403px) 85vw, 403px\" /></p></blockquote>\n<p>🎬✨ Join Us for a Special Screening of RESPECT 🎶👑</p>\n<p>Step into the extraordinary life of the legendary Aretha Franklin with RESPECT, the acclaimed biographical film starring Jennifer Hudson. 🌟</p>\n<p>From singing in her father&#8217;s church choir ⛪ to becoming the undisputed Queen of Soul 👑🎤, RESPECT celebrates Aretha&#8217;s remarkable journey of faith, courage, determination, and musical genius. Featuring unforgettable performances of her greatest hits 🎵, this inspiring film honours the woman behind the iconic voice and her lasting impact on music, culture, and the fight for equality. ❤️✊🏾</p>\n<p>📍 Join us for a memorable evening at Ruach Church – the stunning Streatham Hill Theatre ✨🏛️ and experience this powerful story on the big screen.</p>\n<p>Film starts 8pm</p>\n<p>Tuck shop bar open throughout the film.<br />\n📍 Venue: Ruach Church, Streatham Hill Theatre</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n            \n            <!-- .tribe-events-single-event-description -->\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<!-- Event meta -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-section tribe-events-event-meta primary tribe-clearfix\">\n\n\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-other\">\n\t<h3 class=\"tribe-events-single-section-title\"> Other </h3>\n\t<dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Director </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tLiesl Tommy\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Certificate </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t12A\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Running Time </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t145 mins\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Year </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t2021\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Country </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tUSA\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t</dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-venue\">\n\t<dl>\n\t\t\n\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue\">Ruach Church (Streatham Hill Theatre) </dd>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue-location\">\n\t\t\t\t<address class=\"tribe-events-address\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-address\">\n\n<span class=\"tribe-street-address\">110 Streatham Hill</span>\n\t\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-delimiter\">,</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-locality\">London</span><span class=\"tribe-delimiter\">,</span>\n\n\n\t<span class=\"tribe-postal-code\">SW2 4RD</span>\n\n\n</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</address>\n\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</dl>\n</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\n                        \t\t\n            \n\t\t</div> <!-- #post-x -->\n\t\t\t\t\n\n</div><!-- #tribe-events-content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-after-html\"></div></div><!-- #tribe-events -->\n<!--\nThis calendar is powered by The Events Calendar.\nhttp://evnt.is/18wn\n-->\n                \t\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div id=\"sidepanel-right\" class=\"right-panel-main col-1\">\n                \t<div class=\"right-panel-main-inner\">\n                \t<div class=\"sidebar-contact sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Contact</h4>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-social\">\n    \t        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/streathamfreefilmfestival\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook-alt\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/streathamfilm\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#1e6d6a6c7b7f6a767f735e786c7b7b78777273787b6d6a77687f726d30716c79\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-mail\"></span></a>\n\t\t\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-top:30px;\">        \n\t    <div><a href=\"https://twitter.com/https://twitter.com/streathamfilm\" class=\"twitter-follow-button\" data-show-count=\"false\" data-size=\"large\">Follow @https://twitter.com/streathamfilm</a>\n    <script data-cfasync=\"false\" src=\"/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js\"></script><script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+'://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document, 'script', 'twitter-wjs');</script></div>\n            <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"http://www.facebook.com/streathamfreefilmfestival\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-action=\"like\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-share=\"false\"></div>\n        </div>    \n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-search sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Search</h4>\n    <div class=\"searchpanel\">\n\t\t\n<form role=\"search\" method=\"get\" class=\"search-form\" action=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\">\n\t<label>\n\t\t<span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Search for:</span>\n\t\t<input type=\"search\" class=\"search-field\" placeholder=\"Search &hellip;\" value=\"\" name=\"s\" title=\"Search for:\" />\n\t</label>\t\n</form>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-news sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Latest News</h4>\n    \n    \t\t<div class=\"news_story\">\n\t\t\t<h5><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/2023/09/01/46-free-film-screenings-in-south-london-begin-today-with-free-film-festivals/\">46 free film screenings in South London begin today, with Free Film Festivals</a></h5>\n            <strong>1st September 2023</strong> - <p>The Free Film Festivals September season begins today! We have 46 film screenings taking place this month across Peckham and Nunhead, Streatham, New Cross &amp;&#8230;</p>\n\