t-involved/\">Get Involved</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-30\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-30\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/contact-us/\">Contact</a></li>\n</ul></div>                        </div>                                            \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"header-banner-logo\">\n            \t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\" rel=\"home\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/round-logo.png\" alt=\"Free Film Festivals Logo\"/></a>\n            </div>\n        \t\n            \n            \n        </div>\t            \n\n<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\" style=\"position:relative;\">\n \n\t<div class=\"content-topper\">\n    \t&nbsp;\n    </div>\n    \n \t<div class=\"site-content-inner\">   \n \n \t\t\n        <div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area\">\n            <main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\" role=\"main\">\n            \n            \t<div class=\"left-panel-main col-3\" style=\"padding-top:0px;\">\n                \t<div class=\"left-panel-main-inner\" style=\"padding-top:25px;\">\n                    \n                                            <div class=\"devshare\">\n                        Share\n                        <div class=\"dev-share-buttons\" data-share-title=\"Vertigo\" data-share-text=\"\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Fvertigo-3%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--facebook\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Fvertigo-3%2F&text=Vertigo\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--twitter\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://plus.google.com/share?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Fvertigo-3%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--google\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-google\"></span></a> </div> \n                        </div>\n                                        \n                    <div id=\"tribe-events\" class=\"tribe-no-js\" data-live_ajax=\"1\" data-datepicker_format=\"0\" data-category=\"\" data-featured=\"\"><div class=\"tribe-events-before-html\"></div><span class=\"tribe-events-ajax-loading\"><img class=\"tribe-events-spinner-medium\" src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/plugins/the-events-calendar/src/resources/images/tribe-loading.gif\" alt=\"Loading Events\" /></span>\t\t\t\t\t\n<div id=\"tribe-events-content\" class=\"tribe-events-single\">\n\n\t<!-- Notices -->\n\t\n\t<h2 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-date\">Saturday 12th September 2026</h2>\n    \n\t<h1 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-title\">Vertigo</h1>\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-schedule tribe-clearfix\">\t\n    \n    \t    \t\t            \t<span class=\"tribe-events-cost\">Free</span>\n\t            <span class=\"free\">(No ticket required - First come first served)</span>            \n\t\t\t\t</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tribe-time-header tribe-clearfix\">\t\t\n\t\t1:30PM        \t\t\t(Doors open 1pm)\n\t\t\t</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tribe-venue-header tribe-clearfix\">\t\t\n    \t        \t<span>INDOOR:</span> Streatham Library        \t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-99652\" class=\"post-99652 tribe_events type-tribe_events status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry tag-streathamfreefilmfestival-sfff2026-vertigo-alfredhitchcock-classiccinema-filmlovers-freefilmfestival-volunteerpoweredcinema tribe_events_cat-streatham tribe_events_cat-streatham-free-film-festival filmfestival-streatham cat_streatham cat_streatham-free-film-festival\">\n\t\t\t\n            <!-- Event content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-99655\" src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Vertigo-Poster-300x148.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"397\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Vertigo-Poster-300x148.png 300w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Vertigo-Poster-1024x504.png 1024w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Vertigo-Poster-768x378.png 768w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Vertigo-Poster-85x42.png 85w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Vertigo-Poster-170x84.png 170w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Vertigo-Poster-510x253.png 510w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Vertigo-Poster.png 1146w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 397px) 85vw, 397px\" /></p>\n<p>🌀🎬 A CLASSIC CINEMA NIGHT WITH VERTIGO 🎬🌀</p>\n<p>Join Streatham Free Film Festival for a special screening of Alfred Hitchcock&#8217;s Vertigo—a timeless masterpiece of suspense, obsession and psychological intrigue.</p>\n<p>When a retired detective is hired to follow a mysterious woman, he becomes drawn into a spiralling world of deception, desire and danger. Beautifully crafted and endlessly fascinating, Vertigo is widely regarded as one of the greatest films ever made, with unforgettable performances, stunning visuals and a haunting score that lingers long after the final scene.</p>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re discovering Hitchcock&#8217;s classic for the first time or revisiting a favourite, this is a rare opportunity to experience a true cinematic landmark with fellow film lovers.</p>\n<p>🎟️ Free entry<br />\n🎬 Vertigo (1958)<br />\n🌀 A masterpiece of suspense and mystery<br />\n🎥 Regularly voted one of the greatest films of all time<br />\n🍿 Popcorn optional, intrigue guaranteed</p>\n<p>Lose yourself in one of cinema&#8217;s most mesmerising stories and join us for an unforgettable evening of classic film on the big screen.</p>\n<p>#StreathamFreeFilmFestival #SFFF2026 #Vertigo #AlfredHitchcock #ClassicCinema #FilmLovers #FreeFilmFestival #VolunteerPoweredCinema</p>\n<p>With thanks to Streatham Library for their support.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n            \n            <!-- .tribe-events-single-event-description -->\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<!-- Event meta -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-section tribe-events-event-meta primary tribe-clearfix\">\n\n\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-other\">\n\t<h3 class=\"tribe-events-single-section-title\"> Other </h3>\n\t<dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Director </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tAlfred Hitchcock\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Certificate </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tPG\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Running Time </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t2hr 8mins\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Year </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t1958\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Country </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tUSA\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t</dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-venue\">\n\t<dl>\n\t\t\n\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue\">Streatham Library </dd>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue-location\">\n\t\t\t\t<address class=\"tribe-events-address\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-address\">\n\n<span class=\"tribe-street-address\">63 Streatham High Road, Streatham</span>\n\t\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-delimiter\">,</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-locality\">London</span><span class=\"tribe-delimiter\">,</span>\n\n\t<abbr class=\"tribe-region tribe-events-abbr\" title=\"Streatham\">Streatham</abbr>\n\n\t<span class=\"tribe-postal-code\">SW16 1PN</span>\n\n\t<span class=\"tribe-country-name\">United Kingdom</span>\n\n</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</address>\n\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Website: </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"url\"> <a href=\"https://funpalaces.co.uk/discover/streatham-librarys-fun-palace/#\" target=\"_blank\">https://funpalaces.co.uk/discover/streatham-librarys-fun-palace/#</a> </dd>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</dl>\n</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\n                        \t\t\n            \n\t\t</div> <!-- #post-x -->\n\t\t\t\t\n\n</div><!-- #tribe-events-content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-after-html\"></div></div><!-- #tribe-events -->\n<!--\nThis calendar is powered by The Events Calendar.\nhttp://evnt.is/18wn\n-->\n                \t\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div id=\"sidepanel-right\" class=\"right-panel-main col-1\">\n                \t<div class=\"right-panel-main-inner\">\n                \t<div class=\"sidebar-contact sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Contact</h4>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-social\">\n    \t        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/streathamfreefilmfestival\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook-alt\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/streathamfilm\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#e99a9d9b8c889d818884a98f9b8c8c8f8085848f8c9a9d809f88859ac7869b8e\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-mail\"></span></a>\n\t\t\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-top:30px;\">        \n\t    <div><a href=\"https://twitter.com/https://twitter.com/streathamfilm\" class=\"twitter-follow-button\" data-show-count=\"false\" data-size=\"large\">Follow @https://twitter.com/streathamfilm</a>\n    <script data-cfasync=\"false\" src=\"/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js\"></script><script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+'://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(