s=\"filmlist\">    \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-03-at-11.03.27.png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/jurassic-park-outdoors/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">05th September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">Jurassic Park (OUTDOORS)</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 5 @ 7:15 pm<br />\n                                        The Rookery\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>Roar into the Festival! Prepare for thrills, laughs and plenty of edge-of-your-seat moments. Whether you&#8217;re introducing little explorers to this cinematic classic for the very first time or sharing a favourite from your own childhood, it&#8217;s the perfect way to make memories together and launch SFFF26.</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/jurassic-park-outdoors/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\n                            </div>\n                                \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Weiner-dog-car.png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/weiner-dog/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">06th September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">Wiener Dog</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 6 @ 1:00 pm<br />\n                                        The Mud Room, 25 Leigham Ct Rd, London SW16 2ND\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>🐾🎬 DOG-FRIENDLY FILM SCREENING : WIENER-DOG 🎬🐾 Join Streatham Free Film Festival for a tail-waggingly unique screening of Wiener-Dog at The Mud Room dog grooming&#8230;</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/weiner-dog/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\n                            </div>\n                                \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Swimmers-poster.png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/the-swimmers-outdoors/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">06th September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">The Swimmers (OUTDOORS)</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 6 @ 7:30 pm<br />\n                                        Tooting bec lido\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>&nbsp; 🌊🎬 OPEN-AIR CINEMA AT TOOTING LIDO 🎬🌊 Dive into a special outdoor screening of The Swimmers at the iconic Tooting Lido as part of&#8230;</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/the-swimmers-outdoors/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\n                            </div>\n                                \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Ryan-and-Steve-Crazy-Stupid.png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/crazy-stupid-love-outdoors-pre-film-mixer/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">10th September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">Crazy Stupid Love (OUTDOORS) &#8211; pre film mixer</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 10 @ 7:00 pm<br />\n                                        The Manor Arms\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>&nbsp; Love, Laughs &amp; a Little Dutch Courage&#8230; Looking for love, new friends, or simply a fun night out? Join us for a special screening&#8230;</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/crazy-stupid-love-outdoors-pre-film-mixer/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\n                            </div>\n                                \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/REspect-square.png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/respect-2/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">11th September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">RESPECT</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 11 @ 8:00 pm<br />\n                                        Ruach Church (Streatham Hill Theatre)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>🎬✨ Join Us for a Special Screening of RESPECT 🎶👑 Step into the extraordinary life of the legendary Aretha Franklin with RESPECT, the acclaimed biographical&#8230;</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/respect-2/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\n                            </div>\n                                \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/inside-out-2-2/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">12th September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">Inside Out 2</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 12 @ 11:00 am<br />\n                                        Streatham Library\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>&nbsp; 🧠🌈 A JOYFUL FAMILY FILM WITH INSIDE OUT 2 🌈🧠 Join Streatham Free Film Festival for a special screening of Disney and Pixar&#8217;s Inside&#8230;</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/inside-out-2-2/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\n                            </div>\n                                \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Vertigo-hitchcock.png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/vertigo-3/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">12th September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">Vertigo</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 12 @ 1:30 pm<br />\n                                        Streatham Library\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>🌀🎬 A CLASSIC CINEMA NIGHT WITH VERTIGO 🎬🌀 Join Streatham Free Film Festival for a special screening of Alfred Hitchcock&#8217;s Vertigo—a timeless masterpiece of suspense,&#8230;</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/vertigo-3/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\n                            </div>\n                                \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-05-at-20.36.39.png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/bride-prejudice/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">13th September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">Bride &amp; Prejudice</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 13 @ 1:00 pm<br />\n                                        The British Home\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; 💃🎬 A BOLLYWOOD-INSPIRED ROMANTIC COMEDY: BRIDE &amp; PREJUDICE 🎬💃 Join Streatham Free Film Festival for a special screening of Bride &amp; Prejudice, Gurinder&#8230;</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/bride-prejudice/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\n                            </div>\n                                \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Kenmure-poster.png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/everybody-to-kenmure-street/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">16th September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">Everybody to Kenmure Street</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 16 @ 7:30 pm<br />\n                                        The White Lion Pub\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"