st_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-31\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/get-involved/\">Get Involved</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-30\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-30\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/contact-us/\">Contact</a></li>\n</ul></div>                        </div>                                            \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"header-banner-logo\">\n            \t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\" rel=\"home\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/round-logo.png\" alt=\"Free Film Festivals Logo\"/></a>\n            </div>\n        \t\n            \n            \n        </div>\t            \n\n<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\" style=\"position:relative;\">\n \n\t<div class=\"content-topper\">\n    \t&nbsp;\n    </div>\n    \n \t<div class=\"site-content-inner\">   \n \n \t\t\n        <div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area\">\n            <main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\" role=\"main\">\n            \n            \t<div class=\"left-panel-main col-3\" style=\"padding-top:0px;\">\n                \t<div class=\"left-panel-main-inner\" style=\"padding-top:25px;\">\n                    \n                                            <div class=\"devshare\">\n                        Share\n                        <div class=\"dev-share-buttons\" data-share-title=\"Everybody to Kenmure Street\" data-share-text=\"\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Feverybody-to-kenmure-street%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--facebook\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Feverybody-to-kenmure-street%2F&text=Everybody%20to%20Kenmure%20Street\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--twitter\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://plus.google.com/share?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Feverybody-to-kenmure-street%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--google\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-google\"></span></a> </div> \n                        </div>\n                                        \n                    <div id=\"tribe-events\" class=\"tribe-no-js\" data-live_ajax=\"1\" data-datepicker_format=\"0\" data-category=\"\" data-featured=\"\"><div class=\"tribe-events-before-html\"></div><span class=\"tribe-events-ajax-loading\"><img class=\"tribe-events-spinner-medium\" src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/plugins/the-events-calendar/src/resources/images/tribe-loading.gif\" alt=\"Loading Events\" /></span>\t\t\t\t\t\n<div id=\"tribe-events-content\" class=\"tribe-events-single\">\n\n\t<!-- Notices -->\n\t\n\t<h2 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-date\">Wednesday 16th September 2026</h2>\n    \n\t<h1 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-title\">Everybody to Kenmure Street</h1>\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-schedule tribe-clearfix\">\t\n    \n    \t    \t\t            \t<span class=\"tribe-events-cost\">Free</span>\n\t            <span class=\"free\">(No ticket required - First come first served)</span>            \n\t\t\t\t</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tribe-time-header tribe-clearfix\">\t\t\n\t\t7:30PM        \t\t\t(Doors open 7pm)\n\t\t\t</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tribe-venue-header tribe-clearfix\">\t\t\n    \t        \t<span>INDOOR:</span> The White Lion Pub        \t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-99722\" class=\"post-99722 tribe_events type-tribe_events status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry tag-streathamfreefilmfestival-sfff2026-everybodytokenmurestreet-soulmusicagainstracism-whitelion-communitycinema-documentaryfilm-freefilmfestival-volunteerpoweredcinema tribe_events_cat-streatham tribe_events_cat-streatham-free-film-festival filmfestival-streatham cat_streatham cat_streatham-free-film-festival\">\n\t\t\t\n            <!-- Event content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-99723\" src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Kenmure-poster-300x170.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"170\" srcset=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Kenmure-poster-300x170.png 300w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Kenmure-poster-1024x581.png 1024w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Kenmure-poster-768x436.png 768w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Kenmure-poster-85x48.png 85w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Kenmure-poster-170x96.png 170w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Kenmure-poster.png 1110w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 85vw, 300px\" /></p>\n<p>✊🎬 MUSIC, COMMUNITY &amp; SOLIDARITY: EVERYBODY TO KENMURE STREET 🎬✊</p>\n<p>Join Streatham Free Film Festival for a powerful screening of Everybody to Kenmure Street, the inspiring documentary that captures a remarkable moment of community action and collective resistance in Glasgow.</p>\n<p>When immigration enforcement officers attempted to detain two men in the city&#8217;s Pollokshields neighbourhood, local residents came together in an extraordinary show of solidarity. What followed became a defining story of community power, compassion and standing up for one another.</p>\n<p>This special screening is supported by Soul Music Against Racism, who will help create an evening celebrating unity, inclusion and the strength that comes from communities coming together in the face of injustice.</p>\n<p>🎟️ Free entry<br />\n🎬 Everybody to Kenmure Street<br />\n📍 White Lion<br />\n🎵 Supported by Soul Music Against Racism<br />\n✊ A powerful story of solidarity and community action<br />\n🍿 Popcorn optional, community spirit essential</p>\n<p>Join us for an evening of film, discussion and reflection on the power of collective action and the importance of standing together.</p>\n<p>#StreathamFreeFilmFestival #SFFF2026 #EverybodyToKenmureStreet #SoulMusicAgainstRacism #WhiteLion #CommunityCinema #DocumentaryFilm #FreeFilmFestival #VolunteerPoweredCinema</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n            \n            <!-- .tribe-events-single-event-description -->\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<!-- Event meta -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-section tribe-events-event-meta primary tribe-clearfix\">\n\n\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-other\">\n\t<h3 class=\"tribe-events-single-section-title\"> Other </h3>\n\t<dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Director </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tFelipe Bustos Sierra\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Certificate </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t12A\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Running Time </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t1hr 29\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Year </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t2025\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Country </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tUK\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t</dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-venue\">\n\t<dl>\n\t\t\n\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue\">The White Lion Pub </dd>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue-location\">\n\t\t\t\t<address class=\"tribe-events-address\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-address\">\n\n<span class=\"tribe-street-address\">232 Streatham High Rd</span>\n\t\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-delimiter\">,</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-locality\">London</span><span class=\"tribe-delimiter\">,</span>\n\n\t<abbr class=\"tribe-region tribe-events-abbr\" title=\"Streatham\">Streatham</abbr>\n\n\t<span class=\"tribe-postal-code\">SW16 1BB</span>\n\n\t<span class=\"tribe-country-name\">United Kingdom</span>\n\n</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</address>\n\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Phone: </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue-tel\"> 020 8677 3341 </dd>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</dl>\n</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\n                        \t\t\n            \n\t\t</div> <!-- #post-x -->\n\t\t\t\t\n\n</div><!-- #tribe-events-content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-after-html\"></div></div><!-- #tribe-events -->\n<!--\nThis calendar is powered by The Events Calendar.\nhttp://evnt.is/18wn\n-->\n                \t\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div id=\"sidepanel-right\" class=\"right-panel-main col-1\">\n                \t<div class=\"right-panel-main-inner\">\n                \t<div class=\"sidebar-contact sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Contact</h4>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-social\">\n    \t        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/streathamfreefilmfestival\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook-alt\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/streathamfilm\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#2c5f585e494d58444d416c4a5e49494a4540414a495f58455a4d405f02435e4b\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-mail\"></span></a>\n\t\t\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-top:30px;\">        \n\t    <div><a href=\"https://twitter.com/https://twitter.com/streathamfilm\" class=\"twitter-follow-button\" data-show-count=\"false\" data-size=\"large\">Follow @https://twitter.com/streathamfilm</a>\n    <script data-cfasync=\"false\" src=\"/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js\"></script><script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+'://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js