class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-03-at-11.03.27.png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/jurassic-park-outdoors/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">05th September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">Jurassic Park (OUTDOORS)</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 5 @ 7:15 pm<br />\n                                        The Rookery\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>Roar into the Festival! Prepare for thrills, laughs and plenty of edge-of-your-seat moments. Whether you&#8217;re introducing little explorers to this cinematic classic for the very first time or sharing a favourite from your own childhood, it&#8217;s the perfect way to make memories together and launch SFFF26.</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/jurassic-park-outdoors/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\