                          \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"header-banner-logo\">\n            \t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\" rel=\"home\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/round-logo.png\" alt=\"Free Film Festivals Logo\"/></a>\n            </div>\n        \t\n            \n            \n        </div>\t            \n\n<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\" style=\"position:relative;\">\n \n\t<div class=\"content-topper\">\n    \t&nbsp;\n    </div>\n    \n \t<div class=\"site-content-inner\">   \n \n \t\t\n        <div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area\">\n            <main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\" role=\"main\">\n            \n            \t<div class=\"left-panel-main col-3\" style=\"padding-top:0px;\">\n                \t<div class=\"left-panel-main-inner\" style=\"padding-top:25px;\">\n                    \n                                            <div class=\"devshare\">\n                        Share\n                        <div class=\"dev-share-buttons\" data-share-title=\"Pillion\" data-share-text=\"\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Fpillion%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--facebook\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Fpillion%2F&text=Pillion\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--twitter\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://plus.google.com/share?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Fpillion%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--google\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-google\"></span></a> </div> \n                        </div>\n                                        \n                    <div id=\"tribe-events\" class=\"tribe-no-js\" data-live_ajax=\"1\" data-datepicker_format=\"0\" data-category=\"\" data-featured=\"\"><div class=\"tribe-events-before-html\"></div><span class=\"tribe-events-ajax-loading\"><img class=\"tribe-events-spinner-medium\" src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/plugins/the-events-calendar/src/resources/images/tribe-loading.gif\" alt=\"Loading Events\" /></span>\t\t\t\t\t\n<div id=\"tribe-events-content\" class=\"tribe-events-single\">\n\n\t<!-- Notices -->\n\t\n\t<h2 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-date\">Friday 18th September 2026</h2>\n    \n\t<h1 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-title\">Pillion</h1>\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-schedule tribe-clearfix\">\t\n    \n    \t    \t\t            \t<span class=\"tribe-events-cost\">Free</span>\n\t            <span class=\"free\">(No ticket required - First come first served)</span>            \n\t\t\t\t</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tribe-time-header tribe-clearfix\">\t\t\n\t\t8:00PM        \t\t\t(Doors open 7:30pm)\n\t\t\t</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tribe-venue-header tribe-clearfix\">\t\t\n    \t        \t<span>INDOOR:</span> Batch &amp; Co. Coffee        \t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-99741\" class=\"post-99741 tribe_events type-tribe_events status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry tag-streathamfreefilmfestival-sfff2026-pillion-britishcinema-independentfilm-communitycinema-freefilmfestival-volunteerpoweredcinema tribe_events_cat-streatham tribe_events_cat-streatham-free-film-festival filmfestival-streatham cat_streatham cat_streatham-free-film-festival\">\n\t\t\t\n            <!-- Event content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-99742\" src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Pillion-landscape-300x175.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"175\" srcset=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Pillion-landscape-300x175.png 300w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Pillion-landscape-1024x597.png 1024w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Pillion-landscape-768x448.png 768w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Pillion-landscape-85x50.png 85w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Pillion-landscape-170x99.png 170w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Pillion-landscape.png 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 85vw, 300px\" /></p>\n<p>🏍️🎬 A BOLD AND UNFORGETTABLE NEW BRITISH FILM: PILLION 🎬🏍️</p>\n<p>Join Streatham Free Film Festival for a special screening of Pillion, a funny, provocative and deeply human story about self-discovery, connection and finding the courage to live authentically.</p>\n<p>When a shy young man is drawn into the world of a charismatic biker, an unexpected relationship opens the door to new experiences, challenges and possibilities. By turns tender, darkly comic and surprising, Pillion explores identity, belonging and the transformative power of human connection.</p>\n<p>One of the most talked-about British films of the year, Pillion is a fresh, original and emotionally resonant story that stays with you long after the credits roll.</p>\n<p>🎟️ Free entry<br />\n🎬 Cert 18<br />\n🏍️ A bold and distinctive British drama<br />\n🌟 Funny, moving and refreshingly original<br />\n🍻 Bar open throughout the evening<br />\n🍿 Popcorn optional, adventure encouraged</p>\n<p>Join us for an evening of daring storytelling, unforgettable characters and one of the year&#8217;s most exciting new films.</p>\n<p>#StreathamFreeFilmFestival #SFFF2026 #Pillion #BritishCinema #IndependentFilm #CommunityCinema #FreeFilmFestival #VolunteerPoweredCinema</p>\n<p>With thanks to Batch &amp; Co for hosting.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n            \n            <!-- .tribe-events-single-event-description -->\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<!-- Event meta -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-section tribe-events-event-meta primary tribe-clearfix\">\n\n\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-other\">\n\t<h3 class=\"tribe-events-single-section-title\"> Other </h3>\n\t<dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Director </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tHarry Lighton\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Certificate </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t18\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Running Time </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t1hr 46mins\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Year </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t2025\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Country </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tUK\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t</dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-venue\">\n\t<dl>\n\t\t\n\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue\">Batch &amp; Co. Coffee </dd>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue-location\">\n\t\t\t\t<address class=\"tribe-events-address\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-address\">\n\n<span class=\"tribe-street-address\">54 Streatham Hill</span>\n\t\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-delimiter\">,</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-locality\">London</span><span class=\"tribe-delimiter\">,</span>\n\n\t<abbr class=\"tribe-region tribe-events-abbr\" title=\"Streatham Hill\">Streatham Hill</abbr>\n\n\t<span class=\"tribe-postal-code\">SW2 4RD</span>\n\n\t<span class=\"tribe-country-name\">United Kingdom</span>\n\n</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</address>\n\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Phone: </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue-tel\"> 020 8616 6767 </dd>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</dl>\n</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\n                        \t\t\n            \n\t\t</div> <!-- #post-x -->\n\t\t\t\t\n\n</div><!-- #tribe-events-content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-after-html\"></div></div><!-- #tribe-events -->\n<!--\nThis calendar is powered by The Events Calendar.\nhttp:/