\">Contact</a></li>\n</ul></div>                        </div>                                            \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"header-banner-logo\">\n            \t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\" rel=\"home\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/round-logo.png\" alt=\"Free Film Festivals Logo\"/></a>\n            </div>\n        \t\n            \n            \n        </div>\t            \n\n<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\" style=\"position:relative;\">\n \n\t<div class=\"content-topper\">\n    \t&nbsp;\n    </div>\n    \n \t<div class=\"site-content-inner\">   \n \n \t\t\n        <div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area\">\n            <main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\" role=\"main\">\n            \n            \t<div class=\"left-panel-main col-3\" style=\"padding-top:0px;\">\n                \t<div class=\"left-panel-main-inner\" style=\"padding-top:25px;\">\n                    \n                                            <div class=\"devshare\">\n                        Share\n                        <div class=\"dev-share-buttons\" data-share-title=\"Save The Cinema\" data-share-text=\"\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Fsave-the-cinema%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--facebook\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Fsave-the-cinema%2F&text=Save%20The%20Cinema\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--twitter\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://plus.google.com/share?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffreefilmfestivals.org%2Fevent%2Fsave-the-cinema%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--google\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-google\"></span></a> </div> \n                        </div>\n                                        \n                    <div id=\"tribe-events\" class=\"tribe-no-js\" data-live_ajax=\"1\" data-datepicker_format=\"0\" data-category=\"\" data-featured=\"\"><div class=\"tribe-events-before-html\"></div><span class=\"tribe-events-ajax-loading\"><img class=\"tribe-events-spinner-medium\" src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/plugins/the-events-calendar/src/resources/images/tribe-loading.gif\" alt=\"Loading Events\" /></span>\t\t\t\t\t\n<div id=\"tribe-events-content\" class=\"tribe-events-single\">\n\n\t<!-- Notices -->\n\t\n\t<h2 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-date\">Saturday 19th September 2026</h2>\n    \n\t<h1 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-title\">Save The Cinema</h1>\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-schedule tribe-clearfix\">\t\n    \n    \t    \t\t            \t<span class=\"tribe-events-cost\">Free</span>\n\t            <span class=\"free\">(No ticket required - First come first served)</span>            \n\t\t\t\t</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tribe-time-header tribe-clearfix\">\t\t\n\t\t2:00PM        \t\t\t(Doors open 1:30pm)\n\t\t\t</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tribe-venue-header tribe-clearfix\">\t\t\n    \t        \t<span>INDOOR:</span> The Woodfield Pavilion        \t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-99731\" class=\"post-99731 tribe_events type-tribe_events status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry tag-streathamfreefilmfestival-sfff2026-savethecinema-communitycinema-britishfilm-lovecinema-freefilmfestival-volunteerpoweredcinema tribe_events_cat-streatham tribe_events_cat-streatham-free-film-festival filmfestival-streatham cat_streatham cat_streatham-free-film-festival\">\n\t\t\t\n            <!-- Event content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-99732\" src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Save-the-Cinema-285x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"285\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Save-the-Cinema-285x300.png 285w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Save-the-Cinema-81x85.png 81w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Save-the-Cinema-161x170.png 161w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Save-the-Cinema.png 588w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 285px) 85vw, 285px\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>🎬❤️ A CELEBRATION OF COMMUNITY CINEMA: SAVE THE CINEMA ❤️🎬</p>\n<p>Join Streatham Free Film Festival for a special screening of Save the Cinema, the uplifting true-story-inspired British comedy-drama about the power of film to bring people together.</p>\n<p>Set in a small Welsh town, the film follows the determined Liz Evans as she embarks on an unlikely mission to save her struggling local cinema. With humour, heart and a healthy dose of community spirit, Save the Cinema celebrates the volunteers, dreamers and film lovers who believe that the big-screen experience is worth fighting for.</p>\n<p>As a volunteer-powered festival dedicated to bringing free cinema to local communities, this feel-good favourite couldn&#8217;t be a more fitting choice for Streatham Free Film Festival.</p>\n<p>🎟️ Free entry<br />\n🎬 Save the Cinema<br />\n❤️ An uplifting story of community action<br />\n🎥 Celebrating the magic of the big screen<br />\n🍻 Bar open throughout the evening<br />\n🍿 Popcorn optional, community spirit essential</p>\n<p>Join us for an inspiring evening of laughter, friendship and cinema as we celebrate the people who keep local film culture alive.</p>\n<p>#StreathamFreeFilmFestival #SFFF2026 #SaveTheCinema #CommunityCinema #BritishFilm #LoveCinema #FreeFilmFestival #VolunteerPoweredCinema</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n            \n            <!-- .tribe-events-single-event-description -->\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<!-- Event meta -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-section tribe-events-event-meta primary tribe-clearfix\">\n\n\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-other\">\n\t<h3 class=\"tribe-events-single-section-title\"> Other </h3>\n\t<dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Director </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tSara Sugarman\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Certificate </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t12\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Running Time </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t1hr 49\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Year </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t2021\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Country </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tUK\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t</dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-venue\">\n\t<dl>\n\t\t\n\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue\">The Woodfield Pavilion </dd>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue-location\">\n\t\t\t\t<address class=\"tribe-events-address\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-address\">\n\n<span class=\"tribe-street-address\">Woodfield Recreation Ground, Tooting Bec Common, 16A Abbotswood Road</span>\n\t\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-delimiter\">,</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-locality\">London</span><span class=\"tribe-delimiter\">,</span>\n\n\n\t<span class=\"tribe-postal-code\">SW16 1AP</span>\n\n\t<span class=\"tribe-country-name\">United Kingdom</span>\n\n</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</address>\n\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Website: </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"url\"> <a href=\"https://www.thewoodfield.org/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.thewoodfield.org/</a> </dd>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</dl>\n</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\n                        \t\t\n            \n\t\t</div> <!-- #post-x -->\n\t\t\t\t\n\n</div><!-- #tribe-events-content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-after-html\"></div></div><!-- #tribe-events -->\n<!--\nThis calendar is powered by The Events Calendar.\nhttp://evnt.is/18wn\n-->\n 