azy Stupid Love (OUTDOORS) &#8211; pre film mixer</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 10 @ 7:00 pm<br />\n                                        The Manor Arms\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>&nbsp; Love, Laughs &amp; a Little Dutch Courage&#8230; Looking for love, new friends, or simply a fun night out? Join us for a special screening&#8230;</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/crazy-stupid-love-outdoors-pre-film-mixer/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\n                            </div>\n                                \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/REspect-square.png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/respect-2/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">11th September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3