                          </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">THE ADVENTURES OF PRISCILLA, QUEEN OF THE DESERT</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 19 @ 7:30 pm<br />\n                                        St Matthew&#8217;s Church\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>In this wild, hilarious comedy classic, two drag performers and a transgender woman travel across the Australian desert to perform their unique style of cabaret.</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/the-adventures-of-priscilla-queen-of-the-desert/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\n                            </div>\n                                \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Spinal-Tap-website-2.png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/this-is-spinal-tap-2/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">20th September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">THIS IS SPINAL TAP</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 20 @ 7:30 pm<br />\n                                        The Leather Bottle\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>Turn it up to 11! Spinal Tap, one of England&#8217;s loudest bands, is chronicled by film director Marty DiBergi (the late Rob Reiner) on what&#8230;</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/this-is-spinal-tap-2/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\n                            </div>\n                                \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Hard-Days-Night-website.png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/a-hard-days-night/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">21st September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">A HARD DAY&#8217;S NIGHT (OVER 18&#8217;S ONLY &#8211; SORRY VENUE LICENSING REQUIREMENT)</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 21 @ 8:00 pm<br />\n                                        The Cavern\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>Over two days in the life of The Beatles, the band struggle to keep themselves and Paul McCartney&#8217;s mischievous grandfather in check while preparing for&#8230;</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/a-hard-days-night/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\n                            </div>\n                                \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Sugar-Man-web.jpg); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/searching-for-sugar-man/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">22nd September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">SEARCHING FOR SUGAR MAN (Limited tickets &#8211; please book via Eventbrite &#8211; link below)</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 22 @ 7:30 pm<br />\n                                        Love &amp; Dye\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>Two men set out to find out what happened to a once-popular musician in this investigative documentary. References to rumours about the singer&#8217;s suicide turn&#8230;</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/searching-for-sugar-man/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\n                            </div>\n                                \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Zootopia-2-web.png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/zootropolis-2-kids-screening/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">23rd September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">ZOOTROPOLIS 2 (Kids/Parents/Carers/Guardians screening &#8211; booking required)</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 23 @ 4:00 pm<br />\n                                        Raynes Park Community Church\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>Brave rabbit cop Judy Hopps and her friend, the fox Nick Wilde, team up again to crack a new case, the most perilous and intricate&#8230;</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/zootropolis-2-kids-screening/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\n                            </div>\n                                \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Minari-web.png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/minari/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">24th September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">MINARI</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 24 @ 7:30 pm<br />\n                                        Poppy&#8217;s Funerals\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>In this touching Oscar nominated film a Korean American family moves to an Arkansas farm in search of its own American dream. Amidst the challenges&#8230;</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/minari/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\n                            </div>\n                                \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Hidden-Figures.png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/hidden-figures-4/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">25th September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">HIDDEN FIGURES</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 25 @ 7:30 pm<br />\n                                        West Wimbledon Hall\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>In this modern classic three female African-American mathematicians (Taraji P. Henson, Octavia Spencer and Janelle Monáe) play a pivotal role in astronaut John Glenn&#8217;s launch&#8230;</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/hidden-figures-4/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\n                            </div>\n                                \n                            <div class=\"film-list-list\">\n                                <div class=\"col-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"highlight-white\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Back-to-the-future-web.png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/back-to-the-future-2/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window-white.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">26th September 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>                                \n                                <div class=\"col-3 detail-list\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">BACK TO THE FUTURE</h3>            \n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">\n                                        September 26 @ 7:30 pm<br />\n                                        St Matthew&#8217;s Church\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\n                                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\">\n                                        <p>Marty McFly, a 17-year-old high school student, is accidentally sent 30 years into the past in a time-traveling DeLorean invented by his close friend, the&#8230;</p>\n\t\n                                        <div class=\"readmore\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/back-to-the-future-2/\">Read More</a>\n                                        </div> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                    </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                </div>\t\t\t\t\n                            </div>\n                                                    </div>\n                        <div class=\"filmcal\" style=\"display:none\">><div class=\"cal-title\"><a href=