</span></a> </div> \n                        </div>\n                                        \n                    <div id=\"tribe-events\" class=\"tribe-no-js\" data-live_ajax=\"1\" data-datepicker_format=\"0\" data-category=\"\" data-featured=\"\"><div class=\"tribe-events-before-html\"></div><span class=\"tribe-events-ajax-loading\"><img class=\"tribe-events-spinner-medium\" src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/plugins/the-events-calendar/src/resources/images/tribe-loading.gif\" alt=\"Loading Events\" /></span>\t\t\t\t\t\n<div id=\"tribe-events-content\" class=\"tribe-events-single\">\n\n\t<!-- Notices -->\n\t\n\t<h2 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-date\">Friday 25th September 2026</h2>\n    \n\t<h1 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-title\">HIDDEN FIGURES</h1>\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-schedule tribe-clearfix\">\t\n    \n    \t    \t\t            \t<span class=\"tribe-events-cost\">Free</span>\n\t            <span class=\"free\">(No ticket required - First come first served)</span>            \n\t\t\t\t</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tribe-time-header tribe-clearfix\">\t\t\n\t\t7:30PM        \t</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tribe-venue-header tribe-clearfix\">\t\t\n    \t        \t<span>INDOOR:</span> West Wimbledon Hall        \t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-98681\" class=\"post-98681 tribe_events type-tribe_events status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry filmfestival-raynes-park\">\n\t\t\t\n            <!-- Event content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-98682 alignright\" src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Hidden-Figures-300x205.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"205\" srcset=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Hidden-Figures-300x205.png 300w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Hidden-Figures-1024x700.png 1024w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Hidden-Figures-768x525.png 768w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Hidden-Figures-85x58.png 85w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Hidden-Figures-170x116.png 170w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Hidden-Figures-1200x821.png 1200w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Hidden-Figures.png 1421w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 85vw, 300px\" /><strong>In this modern classic three female African-American mathematicians (Taraji P. Henson, Octavia Spencer and Janelle Monáe) play a pivotal role in astronaut John Glenn&#8217;s launch into orbit while dealing with racial and gender discrimination.</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n            \n            <!-- .tribe-events-single-event-description -->\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<!-- Event meta -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-section tribe-events-event-meta primary tribe-clearfix\">\n\n\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-other\">\n\t<h3 class=\"tribe-events-single-section-title\"> Other </h3>\n\t<dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Director </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tTheodore Melfi\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Certificate </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tPG\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Running Time </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t127\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Year </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t2016\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Country </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tUSA\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t</dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-venue\">\n\t<dl>\n\t\t\n\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue\">West Wimbledon Hall </dd>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue-location\">\n\t\t\t\t<address class=\"tribe-events-address\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-address\">\n\n<span class=\"tribe-street-address\">70 Richmond Road</span>\n\t\n\t\t<span class=\"tr