, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Back-to-the-future-web-768x1001.png 768w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Back-to-the-future-web-65x85.png 65w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Back-to-the-future-web-130x170.png 130w, https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Back-to-the-future-web.png 785w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 230px) 85vw, 230px\" />Marty McFly, a 17-year-old high school student, is accidentally sent 30 years into the past in a time-traveling DeLorean invented by his close friend, the maverick scientist Doc Brown.</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n            \n            <!-- .tribe-events-single-event-description -->\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<!-- Event meta -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-section tribe-events-event-meta primary tribe-clearfix\">\n\n\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-other\">\n\t<h3 class=\"tribe-events-single-section-title\"> Other </h3>\n\t<dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Director </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tRobert Zemeckis\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Certificate </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tPG\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Running Time </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t116\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Year </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t1985\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dt> Country </dt>\n\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\tUSA\t\t\t</dd>\n\t\t\t</dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-venue\">\n\t<dl>\n\t\t\n\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue\">St Matthew&#8217;s Church </dd>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<dd class=\"tribe-venue-location\">\n\t\t\t\t<address class=\"tribe-events-address\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-address\">\n\n<span class=\"tribe-street-address\">Durham Rd</span>\n\t\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-delimiter\">,</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-locality\">London</span><span class=\"tribe-delimiter\">,</sp