          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=UTF-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en-GB\" class=\"no-js\">\n<head>\n\t<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n\t<link rel=\"profile\" href=\"https://gmpg.org/xfn/11\">\n\t    <link rel='stylesheet' id='new-royalslider-core-css-css'  href='https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/royalslider/royalslider.css' type='text/css' media='all' />\n\t<link rel='stylesheet' id='rsDefault-css-css'  href='https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/royalslider/skins/default/rs-default.css' type='text/css' media='all' />\n\t<script>\n(function(html){html.className = html.className.replace(/\\bno-js\\b/,'js')})(document.documentElement);\n//# sourceURL=twentysixteen_javascript_detection\n</script>\n<meta name='robots' content='index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1' />\n\n\t<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.2 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n\t<title>West Norwood Archives - Free Film Festivals</title>\n\t<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/west-norwood/\" />\n\t<link rel=\"next\" href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/west-norwood/page/2/\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"West Norwood Archives - Free Film Festivals\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"West Norwood Free Film Festival to return in October 2026 with a series of Halloween-themed screenings. Thanks to everyone who came to our Spring caper movies in April 2026! With a passion for community film screenings, we’ve been part of this network of volunteer-powered Free Film Festivals since 2017. WNFFF has established close links with local businesses and we’ve shown cool films in unusual settings, such as the Clockworks Museum and West Norwood Cemetery. Other places you might have seen our screenings at include St Luke’s, West Norwood’s oldest church and Sole Luna, a family-run Italian bistro. About half of our screenings are currently family-friendly (suitable for all ages). We are always on the lookout for volunteers. If you’d like to get involved in helping out at our next WNFFF festival, please do get in touch. We would love to hear from you! We always need people to both organise and help run the events. You might get involved in choosing films, updating social media, approaching venues or looking for local sponsors &#8211; and we really need to find some funding. Then, once our screenings are arranged, there’s always lots to do such as setting up the equipment, looking after the audience and so on. No experience needed, just an enthusiasm for film and local events. Email: wnfff@freefilmfestivals.org Or follow us on social media: Facebook: www.facebook.com/WestNorwoodFFF Twitter/X: @WestNorwoodFFF Instagram: westnorwoodfff\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/west-norwood/\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Free Film Festivals\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"CollectionPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/filmfestival\\/west-norwood\\/\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/filmfestival\\/west-norwood\\/\",\"name\":\"West Norwood Archives - Free Film Festivals\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/filmfestival\\/west-norwood\\/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/filmfestival\\/west-norwood\\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/04\\/WNFFF-Quiz-2-2026.jpg\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/filmfestival\\/west-norwood\\/#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\"},{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/filmfestival\\/west-norwood\\/#primaryimage\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/04\\/WNFFF-Quiz-2-2026.jpg\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/04\\/WNFFF-Quiz-2-2026.jpg\",\"width\":300,\"height\":450,\"caption\":\"Film Quiz Night at Sole Luna 2026\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/filmfestival\\/west-norwood\\/#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"West Norwood\"}]},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/#website\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/\",\"name\":\"Free Film Festivals\",\"description\":\"Your guide to Free Film Festivals in the UK\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/?s={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValueSpecification\",\"valueRequired\":true,\"valueName\":\"search_term_string\"}}],\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/#organization\",\"name\":\"Free Film Festivals\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/#\\/schema\\/logo\\/image\\/\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/12\\/fff-favicon-2018.png\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2018\\/12\\/fff-favicon-2018.png\",\"width\":135,\"height\":135,\"caption\":\"Free Film Festivals\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/#\\/schema\\/logo\\/image\\/\"}}]}</script>\n\t<!-- / Yoast SEO plugin. -->\n\n\n<link rel='dns-prefetch' href='//cdnjs.cloudflare.com' />\n<link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" title=\"Free Film Festivals &raquo; Feed\" href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/feed/\" />\n<link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" title=\"Free Film Festivals &raquo; Comments Feed\" href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/comments/feed/\" />\n<link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"text/calendar\" title=\"Free Film Festivals &raquo; iCal Feed\" href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/events/?ical=1\" />\n<link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" title=\"Free Film Festivals &raquo; West Norwood Film Festivals Feed\" href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/west-norwood/feed/\" />\n<style id='wp-img-auto-sizes-contain-inline-css'>\nimg:is([sizes=auto i],[sizes^=\"auto,\" i]){contain-intrinsic-size:3000px 1500px}\n/*# sourceURL=wp-img-auto-sizes-contain-inline-css */\n</style>\n<link rel='stylesheet' id='dashicons-css' href='https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-includes/css/dashicons.min.css?ver=6.9.5' media='all' />\n<link rel='stylesheet' id='tec-variables-skeleton-css' href='https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/plugins/event-tickets/common/src/resources/css/variables-skeleton.min.css?ver=4.15.5' media='all' />\n<link rel='stylesheet' id='tec-variables-full-css' href='https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/plugins/event-tickets/common/src/resources/css/variables-full.min.css?ver=4.15.5' media='all' />\n<link rel='stylesheet' id='tribe-common-skeleton-style-css' href='https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/plugins/event-tickets/common/src/resources/css/common-skeleton.min.css?ver=4.15.5' media='all' />\n<link rel='stylesheet' id='tribe-common-full-style-css' href='https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/plugins/event-tickets/common/src/resources/css/common-full.min.css?ver=4.15.5' media='all' />\n<style id='tribe-common-full-style-inline-css'>\n.tribe-events-list-widget .tribe-event-featured .tribe-event-image,\n\t\t\t\t.tribe-events-venue-widget .tribe-event-featured .tribe-event-image,\n\t\t\t\t.tribe-events-adv-list-widget .tribe-event-featured .tribe-event-image,\n\t\t\t\t.tribe-mini-calendar-list-wrapper .tribe-event-featured .tribe-event-image {\n\t\t\t\t\tdisplay: none;\n\t\t\t\t}\n/*# sourceURL=tribe-common-full-style-inline-css */\n</style>\n<link rel='stylesheet' id='event-tickets-tickets-css-css' href='https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/plugins/event-tickets/src/resources/css/tickets-v1.min.css?ver=5.4.4' media='all' />\n<link rel='stylesheet' id='event-tickets-tickets-rsvp-css-css' href='https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/plugins/event-tickets/src/resources/css/rsvp-v1.min.css?ver=5.4.4' media='all' />\n<style id='wp-emoji-styles-inline-css'>\n\n\timg.wp-smiley, img.emoji {\n\t\tdisplay: inline !important;\n\t\tborder: none !important;\n\t\tbox-shadow: none !important;\n\t\theight: 1em !important;\n\t\twidth: 1em !important;\n\t\tmargin: 0 0.07em !important;\n\t\tvertical-align: -0.1em !important;\n\t\tbackground: none !important;\n\t\tpadding: 0 !important;\n\t}\n/*# sourceURL=wp-emoji-styles-inline-css */\n</style>\n<link rel='stylesheet' id='wp-block-library-css' href='https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-includes/css/dist/block-library/style.min.css?ver=6.9.5' media='all' />\n\n<style id='classic-theme-styles-inline-css'>\n/*! This file is auto-generated */\n.wp-block-button__link{color:#fff;background-color:#32373c;border-radius:9999px;box-shadow:none;text-decoration:none;padding:calc(.667em + 2px) calc(1.333em + 2px);font-size:1.125em}.wp-block-file__button{background:#32373c;color:#fff;text-decoration:none}\n/*# sourceURL=/wp-includes/css/classic-themes.min.css */\n</style>\n<style id='global-styles-inline-css'>\