vals.org/contact-us/\">Contact</a></li>\n</ul></div>                        </div>                                            \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"header-banner-logo\">\n            \t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\" rel=\"home\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/round-logo.png\" alt=\"Free Film Festivals Logo\"/></a>\n            </div>\n        \t\n            \n            \n        </div>\t            \n\n<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\" style=\"position:relative;\">\n \n\t<div class=\"content-topper\">\n    \t&nbsp;\n    </div>\n    \n \t<div class=\"site-content-inner\">   \n \n        <div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area\">\n            <main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\" role=\"main\">\n    \t\n            \t<div class=\"left-panel-footer col-3\">\n                \t<div class=\"left-panel-main-inner\" style=\"padding-top:30px;\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"devshare\">\n                    Share\n                    <div class=\"dev-share-buttons\" data-share-title=\"West Norwood\" data-share-text=\"Share\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fwest-norwood%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--facebook\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fwest-norwood%2F&text=Film%20Festivals%3A%20%3Cspan%3EWest%20Norwood%3C%2Fspan%3E\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--twitter\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://plus.google.com/share?url=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fwest-norwood%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--google\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-google\"></span></a> </div> \n                    </div>\n                    \n                                                \n                                                        \t<h2 style=\"margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">Next Festival</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-frame\" style=\"background-image:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2016/10/West-norwood-film-logo-780x462.jpg); background-size:cover; background-repeat:no-repeat;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/picture-frame.png\" alt=\"picture frame\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-title-stuff\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/west-norwood/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/picture-frame-details.png\" alt=\"picture frame details\" /></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-title-stuff-copy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/west-norwood/\">West Norwood</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"film-date\">16th - 21st April 2026</div>                                \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>                        \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"next-festival-copy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>West Norwood Free Film Festival to return in October 2026 with a series of Halloween-themed screenings.</strong></p>\n<p>Thanks to everyone who came to our Spring caper movies in April 2026!</p>\n<p>With a passion for community film screenings, we’ve been part of this network of volunteer-powered Free Film Festivals since 2017. WNFFF has established close links with local businesses and we’ve shown cool films in unusual settings, such as the Clockworks Museum and West Norwood Cemetery. Other places you might have seen our screenings at include St Luke’s, West Norwood’s oldest church and Sole Luna, a family-run Italian bistro.</p>\n<p>About half of our screenings are currently family-friendly (suitable for all ages).</p>\n<p>We are always on the lookout for volunteers. If you’d like to get involved in helping out at our next WNFFF festival, please do get in touch. We would love to hear from you! We always need people to both organise and help run the events. You might get involved in choosing films, updating social media, approaching venues or looking for local sponsors &#8211; and we really need to find some funding. Then, once our screenings are arranged, there’s always lots to do such as setting up the equipment, looking after the audience and so on.</p>\n<p>No experience needed, just an enthusiasm for film and local events.</p>\n<p>Email: <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#f5829b939393b593879090939c9998939086819c83949986db9a8792\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"4a3d242c2c2c0a2c382f2f2c2326272c2f393e233c2b26396425382d\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p>\n<p>Or follow us on social media:<br />\nFacebook: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/WestNorwoodFFF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">www.facebook.com/WestNorwoodFFF</a><br />\nTwitter/X: <a href=\"http://x.com/WestNorwoodFFF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">@WestNorwoodFFF</a><br />\nInstagram: <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/westnorwoodfff/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">westnorwoodfff</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                    \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div id=\"sidepanel-right\" class=\"right-panel-main col-1\">\n                \t<div class=\"right-panel-main-inner\">\n                \t<div class=\"sidebar-contact sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Contact</h4>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-social\">\n    \t        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/WestNorwoodFFF/\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook-alt\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.twitter.com/westnorwoodfff\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#fc8b929a9a9abc9a8e99999a9590919a998f88958a9d908fd2938e9b\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-mail\"></span></a>\n\t\t\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-top:30px;\">        \n\t    <div><a href=\"https://twitter.com/http://www.twitter.com/westnorwoodfff\" class=\"twitter-follow-button\" data-show-count=\"false\" data-size=\"large\">Follow @http://www.twitter.com/westnorwoodfff</a>\n    <script data-cfasync=\"false\" src=\"/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js\"></script><script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+'://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document, 'script', 'twitter-wjs');</script></div>\n            <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/WestNorwoodFFF/\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-action=\"like\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-share=\"false\"></div>\n        </div>    \n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-search sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Search</h4>\n    <div class=\"searchpanel\">\n\t\t\n<form role=\"search\" method=\"get\" class=\"search-form\" action=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\">\n\t<label>\n\t\t<span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Search for:</span>\n\t\t<input type=\"search\" class=\"search-field\" placeholder=\"Search &hellip;\" value=\"\" name=\"s\" title=\"Search for:\" />\n\t</label>\t\n</form>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-news sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Latest News</h4>\n    \n    \t\t<div class=\"news_story\">\n\t\t\t<h5><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/2023/08/27/join-us-for-a-month-of-free-films-in-south-east-london/\">Join us for a month of free films in South East London!</a></h5>\n            <strong>27th August 2023</strong> - <p>&nbsp; Four FREE film festivals and a special screening kick off next week starting with Peckham &amp; Nunhead, 1-10 September&#8230; &nbsp; Peckham &amp; Nunhead 1-10&#8230;</p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t    <div class=\"readall\"><a href=\"/category/blog\"><strong>READ ALL</strong></a></div>\n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-twitter sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4> <span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span>Latest Tweets</h4>\n        \t<a height=\"200\" data-screen-name=\"WestNorwoodFFF\" class=\"twitter-timeline\" data-theme=\"light\" data-chrome=\"transparent nofooter noheader noborders\" href=\"https://www.twitter.com/westnorwoodfff\" data-widget-id=\"696411500521660416\">Tweets by @@WestNorwoodFFF</a>\n    \t<script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+\"://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js\";fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\"script\",\"twitter-wjs\");</script>          \n    </div>                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"divide\"></div>\n    \n   \t\t\t\n   \t\t\t\n   \t\t\t\n   \t\t\t\n   \t\t\t\n    \t\t\t<div class=\"fff-calendar-container\" style=\"padding-left:0;\">\n                \n                \t<div class=\"calendar-heading\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a name=\"cal\"></a>\n                        \n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>All Events</h2>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"cal-menu\"> \n                            <span class=\"icon-cal\n                                                        \">Calendar</span>\n                            <span class=\"icon-list\">List</span>\n                            <span class=\"icon-images\n                                                        \">Images</span>                                                    \n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n                                        \t\n                    </div>\n                \t\n                    <div class=\"films\">\n                    \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"filmimages\">                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"filmlist\">                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div id=\"filmdiv\" class=\"filmcal\"><div class=\"cal-title\"><a href=\"?view=cal&calmonth=7&calyear=2026\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/btn-previous.png\" alt=\"Previous\" /></a>August 2026<a href=\"?view=cal&calmonth=9&calyear=2026\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/btn-next.png\" alt=\"Previous\" /></a></div>                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n                    \n                </div>\n                \n                <p><a class=\"archivebutton\" href=\"/festival-archive/#west-norwood\"><strong>Festival Archive</strong></a></p>\n                \n                <div class=\"fff-calendar-container\" style=\"padding-left:0; margin-top: 40px;\">                \n                \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n                \n                <div id=\"sidepanel-bottom\" class=\"right-panel-main col-1\">\n                \t<div class=\"right-panel-main-inner\">\n                \t<div class=\"sidebar-contact sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Contact</h4>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-social\">\n    \t        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.