           \n            <div class=\"header-banner-logo\">\n            \t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\" rel=\"home\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/round-logo.png\" alt=\"Free Film Festivals Logo\"/></a>\n            </div>\n        \t\n            \n            \n        </div>\t            \n\n<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\" style=\"position:relative;\">\n \n\t<div class=\"content-topper\">\n    \t&nbsp;\n    </div>\n    \n \t<div class=\"site-content-inner\">   \n \n        <div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area\">\n            <main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\" role=\"main\">\n    \t\n            \t<div class=\"left-panel-footer col-3\">\n                \t<div class=\"left-panel-main-inner\" style=\"padding-top:30px;\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"devshare\">\n                    Share\n                    <div class=\"dev-share-buttons\" data-share-title=\"New Cross &amp; Deptford\" data-share-text=\"Share\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fnew-cross-deptford%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--facebook\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fnew-cross-deptford%2F&text=Film%20Festivals%3A%20%3Cspan%3ENew%20Cross%20%26amp%3B%20Deptford%3C%2Fspan%3E\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--twitter\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://plus.google.com/share?url=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fnew-cross-deptford%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--google\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-google\"></span></a> </div> \n                    </div>\n                    \n                                                \n                                                        \t<h2 style=\"margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">New Cross and Deptford Free Film Festival</h2>\n                            \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-frame\" style=\"background-image:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/QE2A8357-780x462.jpg); background-size:cover; background-repeat:no-repeat;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/picture-frame.png\" alt=\"picture frame\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-title-stuff\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/new-cross-deptford/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/picture-frame-details.png\" alt=\"picture frame details\" /></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-title-stuff-copy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/new-cross-deptford/\">New Cross &amp; Deptford</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"film-date\">24th April to 3rd May 2026</div>                                \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>                        \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"next-festival-copy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Full details of the New Cross &amp; Deptford Free Film Festival programme are now available!</p>\n<p>We have a bumper festival planned with 21 events across ten days, with venues ranging from pubs to parks and from boxing gyms to churches.</p>\n<p>Our launch event is on Friday 24th April at the Deptford Lounge, when we’ll be showing Romy &amp; Michelle’s High School Reunion followed by a school disco! Book your free ticket by following the link <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/nxdfff-opening-night-romy-and-michelles-high-school-reunion-with-after-school-disco-and-dj/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">on the listing</a>.</p>\n<p>Check out the full programme of events below, or download the festival guide in pdf format <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/NxDfff_2026_Guide_v3.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>.</p>\n<p>All screenings are <strong>completely free</strong> and open to all (subject to the film’s age rating) and we’ve got a great line-up of shorts, classic movies, old favourites and family-friendly flicks, all chosen, curated and hosted by our great team of volunteers!</p>\n<p>Have a dance, watch a boxing demo, or just show up, grab some popcorn and settle down to enjoy the film with friends, family or complete strangers!</p>\n<p>Look out for printed programmes after Easter in all our venues and in the Deptford Lounge and New Cross Learning.</p>\n<p>All films screenings are free but we invite people to donate, if their circumstances allow; you can use either card or cash, look out for our volunteers.</p>\n<p>Your donations help us keep the festival going, and most importantly <strong>help us to keep it free for all!</strong></p>\n<p>We are part of Free Film Festivals, a network of volunteer-powered neighbourhood free film festivals.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/nxdfff/?locale=en_GB\" target=\"_blank\">Find us on Facebook</a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/nxdfff/\" target=\"_blank\">Link with us on Instagram</a></p>\n<p>Click on the ‘Festival archive’ link below to check out what happened last time.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                    \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div id=\"sidepanel-right\" class=\"right-panel-main col-1\">\n                \t<div class=\"right-panel-main-inner\">\n                \t<div class=\"sidebar-contact sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Contact</h4>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-social\">\n    \t        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/nxdfff\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook-alt\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.twitter.com/nxdfff\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#fb95839f9d9297969d9e888fbb9c969a9297d5989496\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-mail\"></span></a>\n\t\t\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-top:30px;\">        \n\t    <div><a href=\"https://twitter.com/https://www.twitter.com/nxdfff\" class=\"twitter-follow-button\" data-show-count=\"false\" data-size=\"large\">Follow @https://www.twitter.com/nxdfff</a>\n    <script data-cfasync=\"false\" src=\"/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js\"></script><script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+'://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document, 'script', 'twitter-wjs');</script></div>\n            <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/nxdfff\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-action=\"like\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-share=\"false\"></div>\n        </div>    \n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-search sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Search</h4>\n    <div class=\"searchpanel\">\n\t\t\n<form role=\"search\" method=\"get\" class=\"search-form\" action=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\">\n\t<label>\n\t\t<span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Search for:</span>\n\t\t<input type=\"search\" class=\"search-field\" placeholder=\"Search &hellip;\" value=\"\" name=\"s\" title=\"Search for:\" />\n\t</label>\t\n</form>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-news sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Latest News</h4>\n    \n    \t\t<div class=\"news_story\">\n\t\t\t<h5><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/2026/03/31/new-cross-deptford-free-film-festival-programme-is-live/\">New Cross &amp; Deptford Free Film Festival programme is live!</a></h5>\n            <strong>31st March 2026</stro