tford Free Film Festival is proud to announce TEN days of free films, at EIGHTEEN venues around SE8 and SE14 &#8211;&#8230;</p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t    <div class=\"readall\"><a href=\"/category/blog\"><strong>READ ALL</strong></a></div>\n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-twitter sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4> <span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span>Latest Tweets</h4>\n        \t<a height=\"200\" data-screen-name=\"nxdfff\" class=\"twitter-timeline\" data-theme=\"light\" data-chrome=\"transparent nofooter noheader noborders\"  href=\"https://www.twitter.com/nxdfff\" data-widget-id=\"696411500521660416\">Tweets by @@nxdfff</a>\n    \t<script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+\"://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js\";fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\"script\",\"twitter-wjs\");</script>          \n    </div>                    </div>\n                </div>\n    \n            </main><!-- .site-main -->\n        </div><!-- .content-area -->\n    \n\t</div>        \n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"footer-sidebar\">\n    <div class=\"footer-sidebar-inner\">\n        <div class=\"left-panel-footer col-2\">\n    <div class=\"left-panel-footer-inner\">\n    \n    \t<div class=\"sidebar-contact sidebar-section-footer\">\n                        <h4>Get Involved</h4>\n            <p>Free Film Festivals are completely run by volunteers. Each festival is always looking for more volunteers, so drop them a message through the Contact Us page if you’d like to get involved, and they’ll get back to you soon.</p>\n            <div class=\"readmore\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/get-involved/\">Read More</a></div>\t\t\t\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"sidebar-contact sidebar-section-footer\">\n            <h4>Contact</h4>\n            <div class=\"sidebar-social\">\n            \n            \t\t\t                        \n                    <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/nxdfff\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook-alt\"></span></a>\t                <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.twitter.com/nxdfff\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a>    \t            <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#2846504c4e4144454e4d5b5c684f45494144064b4745\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-mail\"></span></a>                                \n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        \n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"right-panel-footer col-2\">\n    <div class=\"right-panel-footer-inner\">\n   \t\t<div class=\"sidebar-news sidebar-section-footer\">\n            <h4>HIGHLIGHTS</h4>            \n            \n                            <div class=\"col-2\">\n                    <div class=\"highlight\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/mamma-mia-0-poster_1-scaled.jpg); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/mamma-mia/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">21st August 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-2\">\n        \t\t\t<h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">Mamma Mia!</h3>            \n                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">St George&#8217;s Garrison Church, Woolwich | 8:00PM</div>\t\t\t\t\n                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\"><p>Set on an idyllic Greek island, the plot serves as a background for a wealth of ABBA hit songs. Donna, an independent, single mother who&#8230;</p>\n</div>\n                </div>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t                        \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divide\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n    </div>\n</div>\n \n    \n\t    \t<div class=\"footer-outer\" style=\"background-image:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/footer-sidebar-bg-bottom.png); padding-top:50px;\">   \n\t\t \n        <div class=\"footer-inner\">\n            \n            <footer id=\"colophon\" class=\"site-footer\" role=\"contentinfo\">\n           \n           \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-1\">\n                        \n                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\" rel=\"home\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/footer-logo.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"281\" alt=\"Free Film Festivals Footer Logo\"/></a>\n                        \n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"col-1\">\n                        \n                        <h3>Contact us</h3>\n    \n    \t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"footer-contact\">                \n                    \t\t\n<div class=\"wpcf7 no-js\" id=\"wpcf7-f38-o1\" lang=\"\" dir=\"ltr\" data-wpcf7-id=\"38\">\n<div class=\"screen-reader-response\"><p role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></p> <ul></ul></div>\n<form action=\"/filmfestival/new-cross-deptford/#wpcf7-f38-o1\" method=\"post\" class=\"wpcf7-form init\" aria-label=\"Contact form\" novalidate=\"novalidate\" data-status=\"init\">\n<fieldset class=\"hidden-fields-container\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7\" value=\"38\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_version\" value=\"6.1.6\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_locale\" value=\"\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_unit_tag\" value=\"wpcf7-f38-o1\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_container_post\" value=\"0\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_posted_data_hash\" value=\"\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_recaptcha_response\" value=\"\" />