                   \n                    \n                    <div class=\"col-2\">        \n                        <div class=\"top-navigation menualignright\" aria-label=\"Top Right Menu\">\n                            <div class=\"menu-top-right-container\"><ul id=\"menu-top-right\" class=\"top-menu\"><li id=\"menu-item-680\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-680\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/start-a-festival/\">Start A Festival</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-31\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-31\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/get-involved/\">Get Involved</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-30\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-30\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/contact-us/\">Contact</a></li>\n</ul></div>                        </div>                                            \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"header-banner-logo\">\n            \t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\" rel=\"home\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/round-logo.png\" alt=\"Free Film Festivals Logo\"/></a>\n            </div>\n        \t\n            \n            \n        </div>\t            \n\n<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\" style=\"position:relative;\">\n \n\t<div class=\"content-topper\">\n    \t&nbsp;\n    </div>\n    \n \t<div class=\"site-content-inner\">   \n \n        <div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area\">\n            <main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\" role=\"main\">\n    \t\n            \t<div class=\"left-panel-footer col-3\">\n                \t<div class=\"left-panel-main-inner\" style=\"padding-top:30px;\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"devshare\">\n                    Share\n                    <div class=\"dev-share-buttons\" data-share-title=\"Herne Hill\" data-share-text=\"Share\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fherne-hill%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--facebook\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fherne-hill%2F&text=Film%20Festivals%3A%20%3Cspan%3EHerne%20Hill%3C%2Fspan%3E\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--twitter\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://plus.google.com/share?url=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fherne-hill%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--google\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-google\"></span></a> </div> \n                    </div>\n                    \n                                                \n                                                        \t<h2 style=\"margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">Herne Hill Free Film Festival</h2>\n                            \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-frame\" style=\"background-image:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/herne-hill-use-780x462.jpg); background-size:cover; background-repeat:no-repeat;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/picture-frame.png\" alt=\"picture frame\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-title-stuff\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/herne-hill/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/picture-frame-details.png\" alt=\"picture frame details\" /></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-title-stuff-copy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/herne-hill/\">Herne Hill</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"film-date\">27th April - 22nd May 2026</div>                                \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>                        \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"next-festival-copy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We proudly celebrate our 13th year this May 2026 with 15 feature films, a pub quiz, a short film night, and the return of our much-loved 48 Hour Film Challenge. Since our first festival in 2013, we have screened over 180 feature-length films and 138 short films to around 23,000 local residents. </p>\n<p>Last year we were thrilled to win the Herne Hill Society Excellence Award in the community category. For that’s what we’re about, above all &#8211; bringing together our community. So come and join us this year. Screenings are free, no tickets, no need to book &#8211; just turn up! </p>\n<p>Herne Hill Free Film Festival would not be possible without our brilliant team of volunteers who run the show, along with the generous support of our fabulous local sponsors &#8211; <a href=\"https://www.pedderproperty.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pedder Property</a>, <a href=\"https://ilovelowie.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lowie</a>, <a href=\"https://www.taxfile.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Taxfile</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rootsandberries.co.uk/the-glassmakers-cafe\" target=\"_blank\">Roots &#038; Berries</a>, <a href=\"https://venue.lambeth.gov.uk/venues/brockwell-hall\" target=\"_blank\">Brockwell Hall</a>, <a href=\"https://bunheadbakery.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bunhead Bakery</a>, <a href=\"https://volcanocoffeeworks.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Volcano Coffee Works</a>, Artemidorus, <a href=\"https://llewelyns-restaurant.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Llewelyn&#8217;s</a>, <a href=\"https://www.whitefeatherboutique.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">White Feather Boutique</a>, <a href=\"https://wildandlees.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wild + Lees</a> and <a href=\"https://www.thecufflondon.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Cuff</a> &#8211; not to mention the many wonderful venues in the local area. Thank you all for making free film available to our local community!</p>\n<p>We are also grateful to all our audiences for their kind donations. This year we are pleased to be supporting a new charity, <a href=\"https://selmind.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">South East London Mind</a>,    helping to raise awareness for their local mental health and dementia support services. Any donations by card or cash at each of our screenings would be greatly appreciated to help us to continue to deliver our festival and to help this admirable charity to continue its important work.</p>\n<p>If you have any short films, or videos that you’ve made at home, or any footage you’d like to share here please get in touch via messenger on our Facebook Page.</p>\n<p>We are part of Free Film Festivals, a network of volunteer-powered neighbourhood free film festivals. We always welcome new helpers so if you’d like to get involved, we’d love to hear from you. Simply contact us (see contact details at the top of the right hand column of this page or via our social media pages).</p>\n<p>Find us here for the latest festival news:</p>\n<p>INSTAGRAM: <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/hhfreefilmfest/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@hhfreefilmfest</a><br />\nFACEBOOK: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/HerneHillFreeFilmFestival/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.facebook.com/HerneHillFreeFilmFestival/</a><br />\nBluesky <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/hhfreefilmfest.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://bsky.app/profile/hhfreefilmfest.bsky.social</a><br />\nX: <a href=\"https://twitter.com/HerneHillFilm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@HerneHillFilm</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                    \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div id=\"sidepanel-right\" class=\"right-panel-main col-1\">\n                \t<div class=\"right-panel-main-inner\">\n                \t<div class=\"sidebar-contact sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Contact</h4>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-social\">\n    \t        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/HerneHillFreeFilmFestival\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook-alt\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.twitter.com/HerneHillFilm\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#7b131e09151e131217173b1d091e1e1d1217161d1e080f120d1a17085514091c\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-mail\"></span></a>\n\t\t\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-top:30px;\">        \n\t    <div><a href=\"https://twitter.com/https://www.twitter.com/HerneHillFilm\" class=\"twitter-follow-button\" data-show-count=\"false\" data-size=\"large\">Follow @https://www.twitter.com/HerneHillFilm</a>\n    <script data-cfasync=\"false\" src=\"/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js\"></script><script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+'://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document, 'script', 'twitter-wjs');</script></div>\n            <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/HerneHillFreeFilmFestival\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-action=\"like\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-share=\"false\"></div>\n        </div>    \n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-search sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Search</h4>\n    <div class=\"searchpanel\">\n\t\t\n<form role=\"search\" method=\"get\" class=\"search-form\" action=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\">\n\t<label>\n\t\t<span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Search for:</span>\n\t\t<input type=\"search\" class=\"search-field\" placeholder=\"Search &hellip;\" value=\"\" name=\"s\" title=\"Search for:\" />\n\t</label>\t\n</form>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-news sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Latest News</h4>\n    \n    \t\t<div class=\"news_story\">\n\t\t\t<h5><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/2019/02/06/starting-free-film-festival-begin/\">Starting a Free Film Festival – where to begin?</a></h5>\n            <strong>6th February 2019</strong> - <p>If you’ve found out about Free Film Festivals, seen what&#8217;s on, and are interested in starting a Free Film Festival in your area, where’s a&#8230;</p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t    <div class=\"readall\"><a href=\"/category/blog\"><strong>READ ALL</strong></a></div>\n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-twitter sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4> <span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span>Latest Tweets</h4>\n        \t<a height=\"200\" data-screen-name=\"HerneHillFilm\" class=\"twitter-timeline\" data-theme=\"light\" data-chrome=\"transparent nofooter noheader noborders\"  href=\"https://www.twitter.com/HerneHillFilm\" data-widget-id=\"696411500521660416\">Tweets by @@HerneHillFilm</a>\n    \t<script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+\"://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js\";fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\"script\",\"twitter-wjs\");</script>          \n    </div>                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"divide\"></div>\n    \n   \t\t\t\n   \t\t\t\n   \t\t\t\n   \t\t\t\n   \t\t\t\n    \t\t\t<div class=\"fff-calendar-container\" style=\"padding-left:0;\">\n                \n                \t<div class=\"calendar-heading\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a name=\"cal\"></a>\n                        \n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>All Events</h2>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"cal-menu\"> \n                            <span class=\"icon-cal\n                                                        \">Calendar</span>\n                            <span class=\"icon-list\">List</span>\n                            <span class=\"icon-images\n                                                        \">Images</span>                                                    \n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n                                        \t\n                    </div>\n                \t\n                    <div class=\"films\">\n                    \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"filmimages\">                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"filmlist\">                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div id=\"filmdiv\" class=\"filmcal\"><div class=\"cal-title\"><a href=\"?view=cal&calmonth=7&calyear=2026\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/btn-previous.png\" alt=\"Previous\" /></a>August 2026<a href=\"?view=cal&calmonth=9&calyear=2026\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/btn-next.png\" alt=\"Previous\" /></a></div>                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n                    \n                </div>\n                \n                <p><a class=\"archivebutton\" href=\"/festival-archive/#herne-hill\"><strong>Festival Archive</strong></a></p>\n                \n                <div class=\"fff-calendar-container\" style=\"padding-left:0; margin-top: 40px;\