Menu\">\n                            <div class=\"menu-top-right-container\"><ul id=\"menu-top-right\" class=\"top-menu\"><li id=\"menu-item-680\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-680\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/start-a-festival/\">Start A Festival</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-31\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-31\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/get-involved/\">Get Involved</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-30\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-30\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/contact-us/\">Contact</a></li>\n</ul></div>                        </div>                                            \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"header-banner-logo\">\n            \t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\" rel=\"home\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/round-logo.png\" alt=\"Free Film Festivals Logo\"/></a>\n            </div>\n        \t\n            \n            \n        </div>\t            \n\n<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\" style=\"position:relative;\">\n \n\t<div class=\"content-topper\">\n    \t&nbsp;\n    </div>\n    \n \t<div class=\"site-content-inner\">   \n \n        <div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area\">\n            <main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\" role=\"main\">\n    \t\n            \t<div class=\"left-panel-footer col-3\">\n                \t<div class=\"left-panel-main-inner\" style=\"padding-top:30px;\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"devshare\">\n                    Share\n                    <div class=\"dev-share-buttons\" data-share-title=\"Ealing\" data-share-text=\"Share\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fealing%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--facebook\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fealing%2F&text=Film%20Festivals%3A%20%3Cspan%3EEaling%3C%2Fspan%3E\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--twitter\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://plus.google.com/share?url=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fealing%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--google\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-google\"></span></a> </div> \n                    </div>\n                    \n                                                \n                                                        \t<h2 style=\"margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">Next Festival</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-frame\" style=\"background-image:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Dreamgirls-1-780x462.jpg); background-size:cover; background-repeat:no-repeat;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/picture-frame.png\" alt=\"picture frame\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-title-stuff\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/ealing/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/picture-frame-details.png\" alt=\"picture frame details\" /></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-title-stuff-copy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/ealing/\">Ealing</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"film-date\">Now planning our 2018 festival</div>                                \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>                        \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"next-festival-copy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The first <strong>Ealing Free Film Festival</strong> took place on 11-12 August 2017, with two FREE outdoor screenings on <strong>Ealing Green</strong>. Thanks to everyone who suported our <a href=\"https://www.spacehive.com/ealing-free-film-festival?searchText=ealing%20film%20festival\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">crowdfunding appeal</a> to make the festival possible. We&#8217;d love to make the Ealing Free Film Festival happen again next year, and make it bigger too, so do get in touch if you&#8217;d like to get involved. The festival is co-ordinated by <a href=\"http://www.gsmlondon.ac.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GSM London</a> as part of Free Film Festivals. Click on &#8216;Archive&#8217; below to see what happened.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                    \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div id=\"sidepanel-right\" class=\"right-panel-main col-1\">\n                \t<div class=\"right-panel-main-inner\">\n                \t<div class=\"sidebar-contact sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Contact</h4>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-social\">\n    \t                <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/EalingFFF\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a>        \n\t\t\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-top:30px;\">        \n\t    <div><a href=\"https://twitter.com/https://twitter.com/EalingFFF\" class=\"twitter-follow-button\" data-show-count=\"false\" data-size=\"large\">Follow @https://twitter.com/EalingFFF</a>\n    <script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+'://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document, 'script', 'twitter-wjs');</script></div>\n            </div>    \n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-search sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Sear