f=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/contact-us/\">Contact</a></li>\n</ul></div>                        </div>                                            \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"header-banner-logo\">\n            \t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\" rel=\"home\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/round-logo.png\" alt=\"Free Film Festivals Logo\"/></a>\n            </div>\n        \t\n            \n            \n        </div>\t            \n\n<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\" style=\"position:relative;\">\n \n\t<div class=\"content-topper\">\n    \t&nbsp;\n    </div>\n    \n \t<div class=\"site-content-inner\">   \n \n        <div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area\">\n            <main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\" role=\"main\">\n    \t\n            \t<div class=\"left-panel-footer col-3\">\n                \t<div class=\"left-panel-main-inner\" style=\"padding-top:30px;\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"devshare\">\n                    Share\n                    <div class=\"dev-share-buttons\" data-share-title=\"Beckenham Mansion Family\" data-share-text=\"Share\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fbeckenham-mansion%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--facebook\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fbeckenham-mansion%2F&text=Film%20Festivals%3A%20%3Cspan%3EBeckenham%20Mansion%20Family%3C%2Fspan%3E\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--twitter\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://plus.google.com/share?url=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fbeckenham-mansion%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--google\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-google\"></span></a> </div> \n                    </div>\n                    \n                                                \n                                                        \t<h2 style=\"margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">Next Festival</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-frame\" style=\"background-image:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Beckenham-2018-780x462.jpg); background-size:cover; background-repeat:no-repeat;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/picture-frame.png\" alt=\"picture frame\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-title-stuff\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/beckenham-mansion/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/picture-frame-details.png\" alt=\"picture frame details\" /></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-title-stuff-copy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/beckenham-mansion/\">Beckenham Mansion Family</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"film-date\">4th September 2021</div>                                \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>                        \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"next-festival-copy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Small World Cinema’s</strong> annual Family Film Festival is back on <strong>4 September 2021</strong> celebrating children&#8217;s stories and films from around the world. </p>\n<p>We have a packed programme in store for you with short animations, feature films, creative activities and professional masterclasses for kids.   </p>\n<p>Some highlights from the programme include:<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Binti</strong>: a young vlogger and her eco-warrior friend combine forces in a warm and vibrant film from Belgium<br />\n&#8211; <strong>My Dad is a Heel Wrestler</strong>: a heart-warming tale about a professional wrestler and his young son in modern day Japan<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Short animations</strong> for young film buffs from the London International Animation Film Festival<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Kids masterclasses</strong> in vlogging and special effects make-up<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Arts &#038; craft activities</strong> led by local artists<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Animation workshops</strong><br />\n&#8211; <strong>Online films and activities</strong></p>\n<p>For more information please visit our website: <a href=\"https://www.smallworldcinema.com/festival\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.smallworldcinema.com/festival</a></p>\n<p>Tickets on Eventbrite: <a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/family-film-fest-2021-tickets-166500654941\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/family-film-fest-2021-tickets-166500654941 </a></p>\n<p>To keep up to date with the latest programme announcements follow us or email us for any queries.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/smallworldcinema\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook-alt\"></span> smallworldcinema</a> | <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/smallwrldcinema\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span> smallwrldcinema</a> | <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/smallworldcinema/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-instagram\"></span> smallworldcinema</a> | <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#1e6d737f727269716c727a7d77707b737f5e79737f7772307d7173\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-mail\"></span> <span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"7b08161a17170c1409171f1812151e161a3b1c161a121755181416\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                    \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div id=\"sidepanel-right\" class=\"right-panel-main col-1\">\n                \t<div class=\"right-panel-main-inner\">\n                \t<div class=\"sidebar-contact sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Contact</h4>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-social\">\n    \t        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/smallworldcinema\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook-alt\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/smallwrldcinema\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#98ebf5f9f4f4eff7eaf4fcfbf1f6fdf5f9d8fff5f9f1f4b6fbf7f5\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-mail\"></span></a>\n\t\t\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-top:30px;\">        \n\t    <div><a href=\"https://twitter.com/https://twitter.com/smallwrldcinema\" class=\"twitter-follow-button\" data-show-count=\"false\" data-size=\"large\">Follow @https://twitter.com/smallwrldcinema</a>\n    <script data-cfasync=\"false\" src=\"/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js\"></script><script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+'://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document, 'script', 'twitter-wjs');</script></div>\n            <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/smallworldcinema\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-action=\"like\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-share=\"false\"></div>\n        </div>    \n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-search sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Search</h4>\n    <div class=\"searchpanel\">\n\t\t\n<form role=\"search\" method=\"get\" class=\"search-form\" action=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\">\n\t<label>\n\t\t<span class=\"screen-reader