t Involved</h4>\n            <p>Free Film Festivals are completely run by volunteers. Each festival is always looking for more volunteers, so drop them a message through the Contact Us page if you’d like to get involved, and they’ll get back to you soon.</p>\n            <div class=\"readmore\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/get-involved/\">Read More</a></div>\t\t\t\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"sidebar-contact sidebar-section-footer\">\n            <h4>Contact</h4>\n            <div class=\"sidebar-social\">\n            \n            \t\t\t                        \n                    <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/smallworldcinema\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook-alt\"></span></a>\t                <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/smallwrldcinema\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a>    \t            <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#097a646865657e667b656d6a60676c6468496e64686065276a6664\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-mail\"></span></a>                                \n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        \n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"right-panel-footer col-2\">\n    <div class=\"right-panel-footer-inner\">\n   \t\t<div class=\"sidebar-news sidebar-section-footer\">\n            <h4>HIGHLIGHTS</h4>            \n            \n                            <div class=\"col-2\">\n                    <div class=\"highlight\" style=\"background:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/mamma-mia-0-poster_1-scaled.jpg); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:center top; background-size:cover\">\n                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/event/mamma-mia/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/event-window.png\" alt=\"overlay\" /></a>                                \n                        <div class=\"mini-film-date\">21st August 2026</div>\t                            \t\t\t\t\t\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-2\">\n        \t\t\t<h3 class=\"mini-film-title\">Mamma Mia!</h3>            \n                    <div class=\"mini-film-venue\">St George&#8217;s Garrison Church, Woolwich | 8:00PM</div>\t\t\t\t\n                    <div class=\"mini-film-copy\"><p>Set on an idyllic Greek island, the plot serves as a background for a wealth of ABBA hit songs. Donna, an independent, single mother who&#8230;</p>\n</div>\n                </div>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t                        \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divide\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n    </div>\n</div>\n \n    \n\t    \t<div class=\"footer-outer\" style=\"background-image:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/footer-sidebar-bg-bottom.png); padding-top:50px;\">   \n\t\t \n        <div class=\"footer-inner\">\n            \n            <footer id=\"colophon\" class=\"site-footer\" role=\"contentinfo\">\n           \n           \t\t<div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-1\">\n                        \n                        <a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\" rel=\"home\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/footer-logo.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"281\" alt=\"Free Film Festivals Footer Logo\"/></a>\n                        \n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"col-1\">\n                        \n                        <h3>Contact us</h3>\n    \n    \t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"footer-contact\">                \n                    \t\t\n<div class=\"wpcf7 no-js\" id=\"wpcf7-f38-o1\" lang=\"\" dir=\"ltr\" data-wpcf7-id=\"38\">\n<div class=\"screen-reader-response\"><p role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></p> <ul></ul></div>\n<form action=\"/filmfestival/beckenham-mansion/#wpcf7-f38-o1\" method=\"post\"