          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=UTF-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en-GB\" class=\"no-js\">\n<head>\n\t<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n\t<link rel=\"profile\" href=\"https://gmpg.org/xfn/11\">\n\t    <link rel='stylesheet' id='new-royalslider-core-css-css'  href='https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/royalslider/royalslider.css' type='text/css' media='all' />\n\t<link rel='stylesheet' id='rsDefault-css-css'  href='https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/royalslider/skins/default/rs-default.css' type='text/css' media='all' />\n\t<script>\n(function(html){html.className = html.className.replace(/\\bno-js\\b/,'js')})(document.documentElement);\n//# sourceURL=twentysixteen_javascript_detection\n</script>\n<meta name='robots' content='index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1' />\n\n\t<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.2 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n\t<title>South Social Archives - Free Film Festivals</title>\n\t<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/south-social/\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"South Social Archives - Free Film Festivals\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"IDENTITIES 5 -LATIN AMERICA FILM FESTIVAL RETURNS FOR ITS 5TH EDITION, CELEBRATING DIVERSE CULTURES THROUGH CINEMA, DANCE, MUSIC, AND CUISINE! The highly anticipated 5th edition of the Identities Latin America Film Festival is set to take place on August 12th and 13th, 2023, at the picturesque Castle Square in Elephant &amp; Castle. This vibrant festival promises to be a captivating celebration of Latin American culture, showcasing independent cinema, dynamic dance performances, mesmerising music, and delectable regional cuisine. MUSIC AND DANCE This year at IDENTITIES you&#8217;ll have the fantastic opportunity to witness astonishing dancers and incredibly talented musicians displaying their skills. ArtPerUK, the dynamic force that burst onto the UK dance scene in 2019, will be gracing our upcoming event with their enthralling Peruvian folkloric dance performances! Hailing from Brazil, Pé-de-Jurema is an exhilarating band that will take you on a vibrant and euphoric journey through the realms of energetic rootsy Brazilian music. PUPPET SHOW AND CARNIVAL MASKS Valerio Oliveira will be crafting spectacular carnival masks, and Caroline Jones, an incredibly talented artist and filmmaker will be presenting an enchanting short puppet show. Don&#8217;t miss these captivating displays of art and culture that will add an extra layer of excitement to the festival! FOOD TRADERS Dedicated food stalls representing various countries will serve delicious cuisine and drinks, showcasing the rich culinary traditions of Latin America. The event is free but you need to register here! https://www.southsocialfilmfestival.co.uk/ FLOW OF THE EVENT 6:00pm Festival opening with food &amp; drinks 7:00pm Latin American dance/music 8:00 Mask Making and Carnival Puppets 9pm Screening of short films 10:30 pm Audience Award and end of the festival https://www.facebook.com/southsocialfilmfestival https://twitter.com/SouthSocialFilm https://www.instagramcom/southsocialfilmfest/ https://tinyurlcom/YouTube-SSFF\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/south-social/\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Free Film Festivals\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"CollectionPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/filmfestival\\/south-social\\/\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/filmfestival\\/south-social\\/\",\"name\":\"South Social Archives - Free Film Festivals\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/filmfestival\\/south-social\\/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/filmfestival\\/south-social\\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/06\\/Banner-Identities-FFF.jpg\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/filmfestival\\/south-social\\/#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\"},{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/filmfestival\\/south-social\\/#primaryimage\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/06\\/Banner-Identities-FFF.jpg\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/06\\/Banner-Identities-FFF.jpg\",\"width\":1308,\"height\":774},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/filmfestival\\/south-social\\/#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"South Social\"}]},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/#website\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/\",\"name\":\"Free Film Festivals\",\"description\":\"Your guide to Free Film Festivals in the UK\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https:\\/\\/freefilmfestivals.org\\/?s={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValueSpecification\",\"valueRequired\":true,\"valueName\":\"search_term_string\"}}],\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/fr