href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/start-a-festival/\">Start A Festival</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-31\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-31\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/get-involved/\">Get Involved</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-30\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-30\"><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/contact-us/\">Contact</a></li>\n</ul></div>                        </div>                                            \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"header-banner-logo\">\n            \t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\" rel=\"home\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/round-logo.png\" alt=\"Free Film Festivals Logo\"/></a>\n            </div>\n        \t\n            \n            \n        </div>\t            \n\n<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\" style=\"position:relative;\">\n \n\t<div class=\"content-topper\">\n    \t&nbsp;\n    </div>\n    \n \t<div class=\"site-content-inner\">   \n \n        <div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area\">\n            <main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\" role=\"main\">\n    \t\n            \t<div class=\"left-panel-footer col-3\">\n                \t<div class=\"left-panel-main-inner\" style=\"padding-top:30px;\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"devshare\">\n                    Share\n                    <div class=\"dev-share-buttons\" data-share-title=\"South Social\" data-share-text=\"Share\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fsouth-social%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--facebook\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fsouth-social%2F&text=Film%20Festivals%3A%20%3Cspan%3ESouth%20Social%3C%2Fspan%3E\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--twitter\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://plus.google.com/share?url=freefilmfestivals.org%2Ffilmfestival%2Fsouth-social%2F\" class=\"dev-share-buttons__item dev-share-buttons__item--google\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-google\"></span></a> </div> \n                    </div>\n                    \n                                                \n                                                        \t<h2 style=\"margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:20px;\">South Social Free Film Festival</h2>\n                            \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-frame\" style=\"background-image:url(https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Banner-Identities-FFF-780x462.jpg); background-size:cover; background-repeat:no-repeat;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/picture-frame.png\" alt=\"picture frame\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-title-stuff\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/south-social/\"><img src=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/wp-content/themes/freefilmfestivals/images/picture-frame-details.png\" alt=\"picture frame details\" /></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"picture-title-stuff-copy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/filmfestival/south-social/\">South Social</a></h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"film-date\">12-13th August 2023</div>                                \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>                        \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"next-festival-copy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>IDENTITIES 5 -LATIN AMERICA FILM FESTIVAL RETURNS FOR ITS 5TH EDITION, CELEBRATING DIVERSE CULTURES THROUGH CINEMA, DANCE, MUSIC, AND CUISINE!</strong></p>\n<p>The highly anticipated 5th edition of the Identities Latin America Film Festival is set to take place on August 12th and 13th, 2023, at the picturesque<strong> Castle Square in Elephant &#038; Castle</strong>. This vibrant festival promises to be a captivating celebration of Latin American culture, showcasing independent cinema, dynamic dance performances, mesmerising music, and delectable regional cuisine.</p>\n<p><strong>MUSIC AND DANCE</strong></p>\n<p>This year at IDENTITIES you&#8217;ll have the fantastic opportunity to witness astonishing dancers and incredibly talented musicians displaying their skills.</p>\n<p>ArtPerUK, the dynamic force that burst onto the UK dance scene in 2019, will be gracing our upcoming event with their enthralling Peruvian folkloric dance performances!</p>\n<p>Hailing from Brazil, Pé-de-Jurema is an exhilarating band that will take you on a vibrant and euphoric journey through the realms of energetic rootsy Brazilian music.</p>\n<p><strong>PUPPET SHOW AND CARNIVAL MASKS</strong></p>\n<p>Valerio Oliveira will be crafting spectacular carnival masks, and Caroline Jones, an incredibly talented artist and filmmaker will be presenting an enchanting short puppet show. Don&#8217;t miss these captivating displays of art and culture that will add an extra layer of excitement to the festival!</p>\n<p><strong>FOOD TRADERS</strong></p>\n<p>Dedicated food stalls representing various countries will serve delicious cuisine and drinks, showcasing the rich culinary traditions of Latin America.</p>\n<p>The event is free but you need to register here!</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.southsocialfilmfestival.co.uk/\">https://www.southsocialfilmfestival.co.uk/</a></p>\n<p><strong>FLOW OF THE EVENT</strong></p>\n<p>6:00pm Festival opening with food &#038; drinks<br />\n7:00pm Latin American dance/music<br />\n8:00 Mask Making and Carnival Puppets<br />\n9pm Screening of short films<br />\n10:30 pm Audience Award and end of the festival</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/southsocialfilmfestival\">https://www.facebook.com/southsocialfilmfestival</a><br />\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/SouthSocialFilm\">https://twitter.com/SouthSocialFilm</a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.instagramcom/southsocialfilmfest/\">https://www.instagramcom/southsocialfilmfest/</a><br />\n<a href=\"https://tinyurlcom/YouTube-SSFF\">https://tinyurlcom/YouTube-SSFF</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                    \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div id=\"sidepanel-right\" class=\"right-panel-main col-1\">\n                \t<div class=\"right-panel-main-inner\">\n                \t<div class=\"sidebar-contact sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Contact</h4>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-social\">\n    \t        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/southsocialfilmfestival\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-facebook-alt\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/SouthSocialFilm\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span></a>        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#e99a9a8f8f8fa98f9b8c8c8f8085848f8c9a9d809f88859ac7869b8e\"><span class=\"genericon genericon-mail\"></span></a>\n\t\t\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-top:30px;\">        \n\t    <div><a href=\"https://twitter.com/https://twitter.com/SouthSocialFilm\" class=\"twitter-follow-button\" data-show-count=\"false\" data-size=\"large\">Follow @https://twitter.com/SouthSocialFilm</a>\n    <script data-cfasync=\"false\" src=\"/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js\"></script><script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+'://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document, 'script', 'twitter-wjs');</script></div>\n            <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/southsocialfilmfestival\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-action=\"like\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-share=\"false\"></div>\n        </div>    \n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-search sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Search</h4>\n    <div class=\"searchpanel\">\n\t\t\n<form role=\"search\" method=\"get\" class=\"search-form\" action=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/\">\n\t<label>\n\t\t<span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Search for:</span>\n\t\t<input type=\"search\" class=\"search-field\" placeholder=\"Search &hellip;\" value=\"\" name=\"s\" title=\"Search for:\" />\n\t</label>\t\n</form>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-news sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4>Latest News</h4>\n    \n    \t\t<div class=\"news_story\">\n\t\t\t<h5><a href=\"https://freefilmfestivals.org/2023/08/01/identities-5-latin-america-film-festival/\">IDENTITIES 5 &#8211; Latin America Film Festival</a></h5>\n            <strong>1st August 2023</strong> - <p>IDENTITIES 5 -LATIN AMERICA FILM FESTIVAL RETURNS FOR ITS 5TH EDITION, CELEBRATING DIVERSE CULTURES THROUGH CINEMA, DANCE, MUSIC, AND CUISINE! The highly anticipated 5th edition&#8230;</p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t    <div class=\"readall\"><a href=\"/category/blog\"><strong>READ ALL</strong></a></div>\n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar-twitter sidebar-section\">\n\t<h4> <span class=\"genericon genericon-twitter\"></span>Latest Tweets</h4>\n        \t<a height=\"200\" data-screen-name=\"SouthSocialFilm\" class=\"twitter-timeline\" data-theme=\"light\" data-chrome=\"transparent nofooter noheader noborders\"  href=\"https://twitter.com/SouthSocialFilm\" data-widget-id=\"696411500521660416\">Tweets by @SouthSocialFilm</a>\n    \t<script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+\"://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js\";fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\"sc